figuration der Bewegungserkennung","Steuerung des Arlo-Sicherheitssystems"],"pt":["Visualização de feeds de câmera","Configuração de detecção de movimento","Controle do sistema de segurança Arlo","Gerenciamento de gravações","Integração com Claude"],"ru":["Просмотр видеопотока","Настройка обнаружения движения","Управление системой безопасности Arlo","Управление записями","Интеграция с Claude"],"ar":["عرض تدفقات الكاميرا","تكوين كشف الحركة","التحكم في نظام أمان Arlo","إدارة التسجيلات","التكامل مع Claude"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Arlo 技能","Claude","安防系统","智能家居","摄像头直播","录制管理"],"ja":["Arlo スキル","Claude","ホームセキュリティ","スマートホーム","カメラの生放送","録画の管理"],"ko":["Arlo 스킬","Claude","보안 시스템","스마트 홈","카메라 피드 보기","녹음 관리"],"es":["habilidad Arlo","integración de seguridad","cámaras de seguridad","sistemas de vigilancia","Claude","seguridad inteligente"],"fr":["compétence Arlo","intégration de sécurité","caméras de sécurité","systèmes de surveillance","Claude","sécurité intelligente"],"de":["Arlo-Fähigkeit","Sicherheitsintegration","Sicherheitskameras","Überwachungssysteme","Claude","intelligente Sicherheit"],"pt":["Arlo Skill","Segurança Arlo","Integração com Claude","Visualização de feeds de câmera","Configuração de detecção de movimento","Desenvolvimento de skills"],"ru":["Навык Arlo","Система безопасности Arlo","Интеграция с Claude","Просмотр видеопотока","Настройка обнаружения движения","Разработка навыков"],"ar":["مهارة Arlo","نظام أمان Arlo","التكامل مع Claude","عرض تدفقات الكاميرا","تكوين كشف الحركة","تطوير المهارات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"arlo","description":"Manage Arlo security cameras, video doorbell, and smart home security","bodyPreview":"# Arlo Skill\n\n## Overview\nEnables Claude to interact with Arlo for viewing camera feeds, managing recordings, configuring motion detection, and controlling Arlo security system.\n\n## Quick Install\n\n```bash\ncurl -sSL https://canifi.com/skills/arlo/install.sh | bash\n```\n\nOr manually:\n```bash\ncp -r skills/arlo ~/.canifi/skills/\n```\n\n## Setup\n\nConfigure via [canifi-env](https://canifi.com/setup/scripts):\n\n```bash\n# First, ensure canifi-env is installed:\n# curl -sSL https://canifi.com/install.sh | bas","body":"# Arlo Skill\n\n## Overview\nEnables Claude to interact with Arlo for viewing camera feeds, managing recordings, configuring motion detection, and controlling Arlo security system.\n\n## Quick Install\n\n```bash\ncurl -sSL https://canifi.com/skills/arlo/install.sh | bash\n```\n\nOr manually:\n```bash\ncp -r skills/arlo ~/.canifi/skills/\n```\n\n## Setup\n\nConfigure via [canifi-env](https://canifi.com/setup/scripts):\n\n```bash\n# First, ensure canifi-env is installed:\n# curl -sSL https://canifi.com/install.sh | bash\n\ncanifi-env set ARLO_EMAIL \"your-email@example.com\"\n```\n\n## Privacy & Authentication\n\n**Your credentials, your choice.** Canifi LifeOS respects your privacy.\n\n### Option 1: Manual Browser Login (Recommended)\nIf you prefer not to share credentials with Claude Code:\n1. Complete the [Browser Automation Setup](/setup/automation) using CDP mode\n2. Login to the service manually in the Playwright-controlled Chrome window\n3. Claude will use your authenticated session without ever seeing your password\n\n### Option 2: Environment Variables\nIf you''re comfortable sharing credentials, you can store them locally:\n```bash\ncanifi-env set SERVICE_EMAIL \"your-email\"\ncanifi-env set SERVICE_PASSWORD \"your-password\"\n```\n\n**Note**: Credentials stored in canifi-env are only accessible locally on your machine and are never transmitted.\n\n## Capabilities\n- View live and recorded camera feeds\n- Manage motion detection zones\n- Configure armed/disarmed modes\n- Download and share video clips\n- Check battery and device status\n\n## Usage Examples\n### Example 1: View Camera\n```\nUser: \"Show me the backyard Arlo camera\"\nClaude: I''ll pull up the live feed from your backyard Arlo camera.\n```\n\n### Example 2: Mode Control\n```\nUser: \"Arm all Arlo cameras\"\nClaude: I''ll set your Arlo system to Armed mode.\n```\n\n### Example 3: Event History\n```\nUser: \"What motion was detected last night?\"\nClaude: I''ll check your Arlo library for last night''s motion events.\n```\n\n## Authentication Flow\n1. Navigate to my.arlo.com via Playwright MCP\n2. Click \"Log In\" button\n3. Enter Arlo credentials\n4. Handle 2FA via email or text\n5. Maintain session for subsequent requests\n\n## Error Handling\n- Login Failed: Retry authentication up to 3 times, then notify via iMessage\n- Session Expired: Re-authenticate automatically\n- 2FA Required: Wait for code via email/SMS\n- Rate Limited: Implement exponential backoff\n- Camera Offline: Report device connectivity\n\n## Self-Improvement Instructions\nWhen encountering new UI patterns:\n1. Document Arlo web portal changes\n2. Update selectors for new layouts\n3. Track new camera features\n4. Monitor subscription changes\n\n## Notes\n- Arlo Secure subscription for cloud storage\n- Battery-powered wireless cameras\n- Works with Alexa, Google, and HomeKit\n- Geofencing for automatic arming\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:00:18.974Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Home Security Agents needing seamless integration with Arlo security systems for advanced camera feed management and motion detection control.","zh":"非常适合需要与Arlo安全系统无缝集成的家庭安全代理，用于高级摄像头视频流管理和运动检测控制。","ja":"Arloセキュリティシステムとのシームレスな統合が必要なホームセキュリティエージェントに最適で、高速なカメラフィード管理とモーションデテクション制御が可能です。","ko":"Arlo 보안 시스템과 무결점 통합이 필요한 홈 보안 에이전트에게 적합하며, 고급 카메라 피드 관리 및 모션 감지 제어가 가능합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Seguridad para el Hogar que necesitan una integración sin problemas con los sistemas de seguridad Arlo para una gestión avanzada de la alimentación de la cámara y el control de la detección de movimiento.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Sécurité à Domicile ayant besoin d''une intégration transparente avec les systèmes de sécurité Arlo pour une gestion avancée de l''alimentation de la caméra et du contrôle de la détection de mouvement.","de":"Perfekt für Heimsicherheitsagenten, die eine nahtlose Integration mit Arlo-Sicherheitssystemen für eine erweiterte Kameranahrungsverwaltung und Bewegungserkennungssteuerung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Segurança Doméstica que necessitam de uma integração perfeita com os sistemas de segurança Arlo para gestão avançada de feeds de câmara e controlo de deteção de movimento.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов домашней безопасности, которым требуется бесшовная интеграция с системами безопасности Arlo для расширенного управления видеопотоком камер и контроля обнаружения движения.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الأمان المنزلي الذين يحتاجون إلى تكامل سلس مع أنظمة أمن Arlo للإدارة المتقدمة لبث الكاميرا والتحكم في كشف الحركة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interact with Arlo for viewing live camera feeds, managing recordings, and configuring motion detection settings via HTTPS protocol, leveraging bash scripts for installation and configuration.","zh":"赋予代理交互式地与Arlo系统进行交互，通过HTTPS协议查看实时摄像头视频流、管理录制内容以及配置运动检测设置，利用bash脚本进行安装和配置。","ja":"エージェントがArloとHTTPSプロトコル経由でやり取りし、ライブカメラフィードの表示、録音の管理、モーションデテクション設定の構成を行うことを可能にし、bashスクリプトを使用してインストールおよび構成を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 HTTPS 프로토콜을 통해 Arlo와 상호 작용하여 실시간 카메라 피드 보기, 녹음 관리 및 모션 감지 설정 구성이 가능하며, bash 스크립트를 사용하여 설치 및 구성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a interactuar con Arlo para ver alimentaciones de cámara en vivo, gestionar grabaciones y configurar la configuración de detección de movimiento a través del protocolo HTTPS, utilizando scripts de bash para la instalación y la configuración.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interagir avec Arlo pour afficher des flux de caméra en direct, gérer des enregistrements et configurer les paramètres de détection de mouvement via le protocole HTTPS, en utilisant des scripts bash pour l''installation et la configuration.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mit Arlo zu interagieren, um Live-Kamerastreams anzuzeigen, Aufzeichnungen zu verwalten und Bewegungserkennungseinstellungen über das HTTPS-Protokoll zu konfigurieren, wobei Bash-Skripte für die Installation und Konfiguration verwendet werden.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a interagirem com a Arlo para visualizar feeds de câmara em direto, gerir gravações e configurar definições de deteção de movimento através do protocolo HTTPS, utilizando scripts bash para instalação e configuração.","ru":"Позволяет агентам взаимодействовать с Arlo для просмотра видеопотоков камер в реальном времени, управления записями и настройки параметров обнаружения движения через протокол HTTPS, используя bash-скрипты для установки и настройки.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من التفاعل مع Arlo لعرض بث الكاميرا المباشر، وإدارة التسجيلات، وتهيئة إعدادات كشف الحركة عبر بروتوكول HTTPS، والاستفادة من نصوص bash للتثبيت والتهيئة."},"useCases":{"en":["Viewing live Arlo camera feeds","Managing and configuring Arlo security system recordings","Automating motion detection settings updates"],"zh":["查看Arlo实时摄像头视频流","管理和配置Arlo安全系统录制内容","自动更新运动检测设置"],"ja":["Arloのライブカメラフィードの表示","Arloセキュリティシステムの録音の管理と構成","モーションデテクション設定の自動更新"],"ko":["Arlo 실시간 카메라 피드 보기","Arlo 보안 시스템 녹음 관리 및 구성","모션 감지 설정 자동 업데이트"],"es":["Visualización de alimentaciones de cámara Arlo en vivo","Administración y configuración de grabaciones del sistema de seguridad Arlo","Actualización automática de la configuración de detección de movimiento"],"fr":["Affichage des flux de caméra Arlo en direct","Gestion et configuration des enregistrements du système de sécurité Arlo","Mise à jour automatique de la configuration de détection de mouvement"],"de":["Anzeige von Live-Kamerastreams von Arlo","Verwaltung und Konfiguration von Aufzeichnungen des Arlo-Sicherheitssystems","Automatische Aktualisierung der Bewegungserkennungseinstellungen"],"pt":["Visualização de feeds de câmara Arlo em direto","Gestão e configuração de gravações do sistema de segurança Arlo","Automatização de atualizações de definições de deteção de movimento"],"ru":["Просмотр видеопотоков камер Arlo в реальном времени","Управление и настройка записей системы безопасности Arlo","Автоматизация обновлений настроек обнаружения движения"],"ar":["عرض بث كاميرا Arlo المباشر","إدارة وتسجيلات نظام أمن Arlo وتهيئتها","أتمتة تحديثات إعدادات كشف الحركة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires bash for installation and configuration scripts","Arlo security system compatibility required","Dependent on canifi-env for setup and configuration"],"zh":["需要bash脚本用于安装和配置","需要Arlo安全系统兼容性","依赖canifi-env进行设置和配置"],"ja":["インストールおよび構成スクリプトにbashが必要","Arloセキュリティシステムの互換性が必要","設定および構成にcanifi-envに依存"],"ko":["설치 및 구성 스크립트에 bash가 필요함","Arlo 보안 시스템 호환성이 필요함","설정 및 구성에 canifi-env에 의존"],"es":["Requiere bash para scripts de instalación y configuración","Se requiere compatibilidad con el sistema de seguridad Arlo","Dependiente de canifi-env para la configuración y la instalación"],"fr":["Nécessite bash pour les scripts d''installation et de configuration","Compatibilité avec le système de sécurité Arlo requise","Dépend de canifi-env pour la configuration et l''installation"],"de":["Benötigt bash für Installations- und Konfigurationsskripte","Kompatibilität mit dem Arlo-Sicherheitssystem erforderlich","Abhängig von canifi-env für Einrichtung und Konfiguration"],"pt":["Requer bash para scripts de instalação e configuração","É necessária compatibilidade com o sistema de segurança Arlo","Dependente do canifi-env para configuração e instalação"],"ru":["Требуется bash для скриптов установки и настройки","Необходима совместимость с системой безопасности Arlo","Зависит от canifi-env для настройки и установки"],"ar":["يتطلب bash لنصوص التثبيت والتهيئة","يتطلب توافقًا مع نظام أمن Arlo","يعتمد على canifi-env للإعداد والتهيئة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2ffb43bb57c52110adf2f65308bec436046d7f212dd2b3ee82e976895adaa3be","qualityScore":60}');
