INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('pradeepmouli/lspeasy/changelog-automation', 'changelog-automation', 'pradeepmouli', 'lspeasy', 'community', 'changelog-automation pradeepmouli lspeasy community The changelog-automation skill provides an ergonomic and accessible TypeScript SDK for LSP clients/servers, automating changelog generation and release notes. It benefits developers and teams managing version control and release workflows. changelog-automation 提供了自动化生成变更日志、发布说明和版本管理的工具与模式。它遵循行业标准，支持 Conventional Commits 和语义化版本控制，可集成到 GitHub/GitLab 工作流中。 changelog-automation は、変更履歴の自動生成、リリースノート、バージョン管理のためのパターンとツールを提供します。業界標準に準拠し、Conventional Commits とセマンティックバージョニングをサポートし、GitHub/GitLab ワークフローに統合できます。 changelog-automation은 자동 변경 로그 생성, 릴리스 노트, 버전 관리를 위한 패턴과 도구를 제공합니다. 업계 표준을 따르며 Conventional Commits와 Semantic Versioning을 지원하고 GitHub/GitLab 워크플로우에 통합할 수 있습니다. changelog-automation es un conjunto de patrones y herramientas para automatizar la generación de changelogs, notas de lanzamiento y gestión de versiones. Sigue estándares de la industria como Conventional Commits y el formato Keep a Changelog para flujos de trabajo en GitHub y GitLab. changelog-automation est un ensemble de modèles et d''outils pour automatiser la génération de changelogs, de notes de version et la gestion des versions. Il suit les standards industriels comme les Conventional Commits et le format Keep a Changelog pour les workflows GitHub et GitLab. changelog-automation ist ein Set von Patterns und Tools zur Automatisierung der Changelog-Generierung, von Release Notes und Versionsverwaltung. Es folgt Industriestandards wie Conventional Commits und dem Keep a Changelog-Format für GitHub- und GitLab-Workflows. O SDK de TypeScript para clientes e servidores LSP permite a automação de changelog, seguindo padrões da indústria SDK TypeScript для клиентов и серверов LSP позволяет автоматизировать changelog, следуя отраслевым стандартам SDK TypeScript لعميل و خادم LSP يسمح بالتطبيق الآلي لسجل التغيير، متبعة معايير الصناعة how to use changelog-automation changelog-automation setup guide changelog-automation alternative automated release note generation Conventional Commits tutorial semantic versioning best practices changelog-automation install GitHub release notes automation changelog-automation vs manual changelog changelog-automation 自动化变更日志生成 Conventional Commits 规范 语义化版本管理 GitHub 发布说明自动化 GitLab 发布说明生成 Keep a Changelog 格式 提交消息标准化 AI 工具自动化 Generates GitHub/GitLab release notes Implements Conventional Commits for standardized commit message formats Manages semantic versioning for accurate version control Creates release note workflows for streamlined development Supports Keep a Changelog format for organized change tracking Automates changelog generation for reduced manual effort changelog-automation is a set of patterns and tools for automating changelog generation, release notes, and version management following industry standards');
