d GitLab-Release-Notes","Verwaltung von semantischen Versionen"],"pt":["Suporte a padrões de desenvolvimento como Conventional Commits","Geração automática de registros de alterações","Integração com ferramentas de gerenciamento de versão como GitHub e GitLab","Suporte a formatos de mensagem de commit personalizados","Geração de notas de lançamento automatizadas"],"ru":["Поддержка padrões разработки как Conventional Commits","Автоматическая генерация журналов изменений","Интеграция с инструментами управления версиями как GitHub и GitLab","Поддержка пользовательских форматов сообщений о коммитах","Автоматическая генерация заметок о выпуске"],"ar":["دعم نمط التطوير مثل التزامات التغييرات التقليدية","توليد آلي لسجلات التغييرات","التكامل مع أدوات إدارة الإصدارات مثل GitHub و GitLab","دعم تنسيقات رسائل التزام مخصصة","توليد آلي لمذكرات الإصدار"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use changelog-automation","what is changelog-automation","changelog-automation alternative","changelog-automation vs standard-version","changelog-automation install","changelog-automation setup guide","automate conventional commits","github release notes automation","semantic versioning automation"],"zh":["自动变更日志","Changelog Automation","变更日志生成","发布说明","版本管理","Conventional Commits","语义版本","AI工具","AIエージェント"],"ja":["自動変更ログ","Changelog Automation","変更ログ生成","リリースノート","バージョン管理","Conventional Commits","セマンティックバージョニング","AIエージェント","開発ツール"],"ko":["자동 변경 로그","Changelog Automation","변경 로그 생성","릴리즈 노트","버전 관리","Conventional Commits","语义 버전","AI 에이전트","개발 도구"],"es":["automatización de registros de cambios","herramientas de automatización de changelog","Convencional Commits","generación de notas de lanzamiento","estándarización de mensajes de commit","gestión de versiones semánticas","registros de cambios automáticos"],"fr":["automatisation des journaux des modifications","outils d''automatisation de changelog","Commits Conventionnels","génération de notes de publication","standardisation des formats de messages de commit","gestion de versions sémantiques","journaux des modifications automatiques"],"de":["Changelog-Automatisierung","Changelog-Automatisierungstools","Conventional Commits","Automatische Release-Note-Generierung","Standardisierung von Commit-Nachrichtenformaten","Verwaltung von semantischen Versionen","Automatische Changelogs"],"pt":["automação de changelog","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","gerenciamento de versão","Conventional Commits","registros de alterações","notas de lançamento","GitHub","GitLab"],"ru":["автоматизация изменений","ИИ Агенты","инструменты разработки","управление версиями","Conventional Commits","журналы изменений","заметки о выпуске","GitHub","GitLab"],"ar":["آلة تشغيل سجل التغييرات","أدوات التطوير","إدارة الإصدارات","التزامات التغييرات التقليدية","سجلات التغييرات","مذكرات الإصدار","GitHub","GitLab"]}},"owner":"pradeepmouli","repo":"lsproxy","repoPath":"pradeepmouli/lsproxy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T12:59:22.281Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"changelog-automation","description":"Automate changelog generation from commits, PRs, and releases following Keep a Changelog format. Use when setting up release workflows, generating release notes, or standardizing commit conventions.","bodyPreview":"# Changelog Automation\n\nPatterns and tools for automating changelog generation, release notes, and version management following industry standards.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up automated changelog generation\n- Implementing Conventional Commits\n- Creating release note workflows\n- Standardizing commit message formats\n- Generating GitHub/GitLab release notes\n- Managing semantic versioning\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Keep a Changelog Format\n\n```markdown\n# Changelog\n\nAll notable changes to","body":"# Changelog Automation\n\nPatterns and tools for automating changelog generation, release notes, and version management following industry standards.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up automated changelog generation\n- Implementing Conventional Commits\n- Creating release note workflows\n- Standardizing commit message formats\n- Generating GitHub/GitLab release notes\n- Managing semantic versioning\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Keep a Changelog Format\n\n```markdown\n# Changelog\n\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\n\nThe format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),\nand this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).\n\n## [Unreleased]\n\n### Added\n\n- New feature X\n\n## [1.2.0] - 2024-01-15\n\n### Added\n\n- User profile avatars\n- Dark mode support\n\n### Changed\n\n- Improved loading performance by 40%\n\n### Deprecated\n\n- Old authentication API (use v2)\n\n### Removed\n\n- Legacy payment gateway\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Login timeout issue (#123)\n\n### Security\n\n- Updated dependencies for CVE-2024-1234\n\n[Unreleased]: https://github.com/user/repo/compare/v1.2.0...HEAD\n[1.2.0]: https://github.com/user/repo/compare/v1.1.0...v1.2.0\n```\n\n### 2. Conventional Commits\n\n```\n<type>[optional scope]: <description>\n\n[optional body]\n\n[optional footer(s)]\n```\n\n| Type       | Description      | Changelog Section  |\n| ---------- | ---------------- | ------------------ |\n| `feat`     | New feature      | Added              |\n| `fix`      | Bug fix          | Fixed              |\n| `docs`     | Documentation    | (usually excluded) |\n| `style`    | Formatting       | (usually excluded) |\n| `refactor` | Code restructure | Changed            |\n| `perf`     | Performance      | Changed            |\n| `test`     | Tests            | (usually excluded) |\n| `chore`    | Maintenance      | (usually excluded) |\n| `ci`       | CI changes       | (usually excluded) |\n| `build`    | Build system     | (usually excluded) |\n| `revert`   | Revert commit    | Removed            |\n\n### 3. Semantic Versioning\n\n```\nMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH\n\nMAJOR: Breaking changes (feat! or BREAKING CHANGE)\nMINOR: New features (feat)\nPATCH: Bug fixes (fix)\n```\n\n## Implementation\n\n### Method 1: Conventional Changelog (Node.js)\n\n```bash\n# Install tools\nnpm install -D @commitlint/cli @commitlint/config-conventional\nnpm install -D husky\nnpm install -D standard-version\n# or\nnpm install -D semantic-release\n\n# Setup commitlint\ncat > commitlint.config.js << ''EOF''\nmodule.exports = {\n  extends: [''@commitlint/config-conventional''],\n  rules: {\n    ''type-enum'': [\n      2,\n      ''always'',\n      [\n        ''feat'',\n        ''fix'',\n        ''docs'',\n        ''style'',\n        ''refactor'',\n        ''perf'',\n        ''test'',\n        ''chore'',\n        ''ci'',\n        ''build'',\n        ''revert'',\n      ],\n    ],\n    ''subject-case'': [2, ''never'', [''start-case'', ''pascal-case'', ''upper-case'']],\n    ''subject-max-length'': [2, ''always'', 72],\n  },\n};\nEOF\n\n# Setup husky\nnpx husky init\necho \"npx --no -- commitlint --edit \\$1\" > .husky/commit-msg\n```\n\n### Method 2: standard-version Configuration\n\n```javascript\n// .versionrc.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  types: [\n    { type: \"feat\", section: \"Features\" },\n    { type: \"fix\", section: \"Bug Fixes\" },\n    { type: \"perf\", section: \"Performance Improvements\" },\n    { type: \"revert\", section: \"Reverts\" },\n    { type: \"docs\", section: \"Documentation\", hidden: true },\n    { type: \"style\", section: \"Styles\", hidden: true },\n    { type: \"chore\", section: \"Miscellaneous\", hidden: true },\n    { type: \"refactor\", section: \"Code Refactoring\", hidden: true },\n    { type: \"test\", section: \"Tests\", hidden: true },\n    { type: \"build\", section: \"Build System\", hidden: true },\n    { type: \"ci\", section: \"CI/CD\", hidden: true },\n  ],\n  commitUrlFormat: \"{{host}}/{{owner}}/{{repository}}/commit/{{hash}}\",\n  compareUrlFormat:\n    \"{{host}}/{{owner}}/{{repository}}/compare/{{previousTag}}...{{currentTag}}\",\n  issueUrlFormat: \"{{host}}/{{owner}}/{{repository}}/issues/{{id}}\",\n  userUrlFormat: \"{{host}}/{{user}}\",\n  releaseCommitMessageFormat: \"chore(release): {{currentTag}}\",\n  scripts: {\n    prebump: ''echo \"Running prebump\"'',\n    postbump: ''echo \"Running postbump\"'',\n    prechangelog: ''echo \"Running prechangelog\"'',\n    postchangelog: ''echo \"Running postchangelog\"'',\n  },\n};\n```\n\n```json\n// package.json scripts\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"release\": \"standard-version\",\n    \"release:minor\": \"standard-version --release-as minor\",\n    \"release:major\": \"standard-version --release-as major\",\n    \"release:patch\": \"standard-version --release-as patch\",\n    \"release:dry\": \"standard-version --dry-run\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Method 3: semantic-release (Full Automation)\n\n```javascript\n// release.config.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  branches: [\n    \"main\",\n    { name: \"beta\", prerelease: true },\n    { name: \"alpha\", prerelease: true },\n  ],\n  plugins: [\n    \"@semantic-release/commit-analyzer\",\n    \"@semantic-release/release-notes-generator\",\n    [\n      \"@semantic-release/changelog\",\n      {\n        changelogFile: \"CHANGELOG.md\",\n      },\n    ],\n    [\n      \"@semantic-release/npm\",\n      {\n        npmPublish: true,\n      },\n    ],\n    [\n      \"@semantic-release/github\",\n      {\n        assets: [\"dist/**/*.js\", \"dist/**/*.css\"],\n      },\n    ],\n    [\n      \"@semantic-release/git\",\n      {\n        assets: [\"CHANGELOG.md\", \"package.json\"],\n        message:\n          \"chore(release): ${nextRelease.version} [skip ci]\\n\\n${nextRelease.notes}\",\n      },\n    ],\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### Method 4: GitHub Actions Workflow\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/release.yml\nname: Release\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n  workflow_dispatch:\n    inputs:\n      release_type:\n        description: \"Release type\"\n        required: true\n        default: \"patch\"\n        type: choice\n        options:\n          - patch\n          - minor\n          - major\n\npermissions:\n  contents: write\n  pull-requests: write\n\njobs:\n  release:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n        with:\n          fetch-depth: 0\n          token: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: \"20\"\n          cache: \"npm\"\n\n      - run: npm ci\n\n      - name: Configure Git\n        run: |\n          git config user.name \"github-actions[bot]\"\n          git config user.email \"github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com\"\n\n      - name: Run semantic-release\n        env:\n          GITHUB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n          NPM_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}\n        run: npx semantic-release\n\n  # Alternative: manual release with standard-version\n  manual-release:\n    if: github.event_name == ''workflow_dispatch''\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n        with:\n          fetch-depth: 0\n\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: \"20\"\n\n      - run: npm ci\n\n      - name: Configure Git\n        run: |\n          git config user.name \"github-actions[bot]\"\n          git config user.email \"github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com\"\n\n      - name: Bump version and generate changelog\n        run: npx standard-version --release-as ${{ inputs.release_type }}\n\n      - name: Push changes\n        run: git push --follow-tags origin main\n\n      - name: Create GitHub Release\n        uses: softprops/action-gh-release@v1\n        with:\n          tag_name: ${{ steps.version.outputs.tag }}\n          body_path: RELEASE_NOTES.md\n          generate_release_notes: true\n```\n\n### Method 5: git-cliff (Rust-based, Fast)\n\n```toml\n# cliff.toml\n[changelog]\nheader = \"\"\"\n# Changelog\n\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\n\n\"\"\"\nbody = \"\"\"\n{% if version %}\\\n    ## [{{ version | trim_start_matches(pat=\"v\") }}] - {{ timestamp | date(format=\"%Y-%m-%d\") }}\n{% else %}\\\n    ## [Unreleased]\n{% endif %}\\\n{% for group, commits in commits | group_by(attribute=\"group\") %}\n    ### {{ group | upper_first }}\n    {% for commit in commits %}\n        - {% if commit.scope %}**{{ commit.scope }}:** {% endif %}\\\n            {{ commit.message | upper_first }}\\\n            {% if commit.github.pr_number %} ([#{{ commit.github.pr_number }}](https://github.com/owner/repo/pull/{{ commit.github.pr_number }})){% endif %}\\\n    {% endfor %}\n{% endfor %}\n\"\"\"\nfooter = \"\"\"\n{% for release in releases -%}\n    {% if release.version -%}\n        {% if release.previous.version -%}\n            [{{ release.version | trim_start_matches(pat=\"v\") }}]: \\\n                https://github.com/owner/repo/compare/{{ release.previous.version }}...{{ release.version }}\n        {% endif -%}\n    {% else -%}\n        [unreleased]: https://github.com/owner/repo/compare/{{ release.previous.version }}...HEAD\n    {% endif -%}\n{% endfor %}\n\"\"\"\ntrim = true\n\n[git]\nconventional_commits = true\nfilter_unconventional = true\nsplit_commits = false\ncommit_parsers = [\n    { message = \"^feat\", group = \"Features\" },\n    { message = \"^fix\", group = \"Bug Fixes\" },\n    { message = \"^doc\", group = \"Documentation\" },\n    { message = \"^perf\", group = \"Performance\" },\n    { message = \"^refactor\", group = \"Refactoring\" },\n    { message = \"^style\", group = \"Styling\" },\n    { message = \"^test\", group = \"Testing\" },\n    { message = \"^chore\\\\(release\\\\)\", skip = true },\n    { message = \"^chore\", group = \"Miscellaneous\" },\n]\nfilter_commits = false\ntag_pattern = \"v[0-9]*\"\nskip_tags = \"\"\nignore_tags = \"\"\ntopo_order = false\nsort_commits = \"oldest\"\n\n[github]\nowner = \"owner\"\nrepo = \"repo\"\n```\n\n```bash\n# Generate changelog\ngit cliff -o CHANGELOG.md\n\n# Generate for specific range\ngit cliff v1.0.0..v2.0.0 -o RELEASE_NOTES.md\n\n# Preview without writing\ngit cliff --unreleased --dry-run\n```\n\n### Method 6: Python (commitizen)\n\n```toml\n# pyproject.toml\n[tool.commitizen]\nname = \"cz_conventional_commits\"\nversion = \"1.0.0\"\nversion_files = [\n    \"pyproject.toml:version\",\n    \"src/__init__.py:__version__\",\n]\ntag_format = \"v$version\"\nupdate_changelog_on_bump = true\nchangelog_incremental = true\nchangelog_start_rev = \"v0.1.0\"\n\n[tool.commitizen.customize]\nmessage_template = \"{{change_type}}{% if scope %}({{scope}}){% endif %}: {{message}}\"\nschema = \"<type>(<scope>): <subject>\"\nschema_pattern = \"^(feat|fix|docs|style|refactor|perf|test|chore)(\\\\(\\\\w+\\\\))?:\\\\s.*\"\nbump_pattern = \"^(feat|fix|perf|refactor)\"\nbump_map = {\"feat\" = \"MINOR\", \"fix\" = \"PATCH\", \"perf\" = \"PATCH\", \"refactor\" = \"PATCH\"}\n```\n\n```bash\n# Install\npip install commitizen\n\n# Create commit interactively\ncz commit\n\n# Bump version and update changelog\ncz bump --changelog\n\n# Check commits\ncz check --rev-range HEAD~5..HEAD\n```\n\n## Release Notes Templates\n\n### GitHub Release Template\n\n```markdown\n## What''s Changed\n\n### 🚀 Features\n\n{{ range .Features }}\n\n- {{ .Title }} by @{{ .Author }} in #{{ .PR }}\n  {{ end }}\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n{{ range .Fixes }}\n\n- {{ .Title }} by @{{ .Author }} in #{{ .PR }}\n  {{ end }}\n\n### 📚 Documentation\n\n{{ range .Docs }}\n\n- {{ .Title }} by @{{ .Author }} in #{{ .PR }}\n  {{ end }}\n\n### 🔧 Maintenance\n\n{{ range .Chores }}\n\n- {{ .Title }} by @{{ .Author }} in #{{ .PR }}\n  {{ end }}\n\n## New Contributors\n\n{{ range .NewContributors }}\n\n- @{{ .Username }} made their first contribution in #{{ .PR }}\n  {{ end }}\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/owner/repo/compare/v{{ .Previous }}...v{{ .Current }}\n```\n\n### Internal Release Notes\n\n```markdown\n# Release v2.1.0 - January 15, 2024\n\n## Summary\n\nThis release introduces dark mode support and improves checkout performance\nby 40%. It also includes important security updates.\n\n## Highlights\n\n### 🌙 Dark Mode\n\nUsers can now switch to dark mode from settings. The preference is\nautomatically saved and synced across devices.\n\n### ⚡ Performance\n\n- Checkout flow is 40% faster\n- Reduced bundle size by 15%\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\nNone in this release.\n\n## Upgrade Guide\n\nNo special steps required. Standard deployment process applies.\n\n## Known Issues\n\n- Dark mode may flicker on initial load (fix scheduled for v2.1.1)\n\n## Dependencies Updated\n\n| Package | From    | To      | Reason                   |\n| ------- | ------- | ------- | ------------------------ |\n| react   | 18.2.0  | 18.3.0  | Performance improvements |\n| lodash  | 4.17.20 | 4.17.21 | Security patch           |\n```\n\n## Commit Message Examples\n\n```bash\n# Feature with scope\nfeat(auth): add OAuth2 support for Google login\n\n# Bug fix with issue reference\nfix(checkout): resolve race condition in payment processing\n\nCloses #123\n\n# Breaking change\nfeat(api)!: change user endpoint response format\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: The user endpoint now returns `userId` instead of `id`.\nMigration guide: Update all API consumers to use the new field name.\n\n# Multiple paragraphs\nfix(database): handle connection timeouts gracefully\n\nPreviously, connection timeouts would cause the entire request to fail\nwithout retry. This change implements exponential backoff with up to\n3 retries before failing.\n\nThe timeout threshold has been increased from 5s to 10s based on p99\nlatency analysis.\n\nFixes #456\nReviewed-by: @alice\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Follow Conventional Commits** - Enables automation\n- **Write clear messages** - Future you will thank you\n- **Reference issues** - Link commits to tickets\n- **Use scopes consistently** - Define team conventions\n- **Automate releases** - Reduce manual errors\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t mix changes** - One logical change per commit\n- **Don''t skip validation** - Use commitlint\n- **Don''t manual edit** - Generated changelogs only\n- **Don''t forget breaking changes** - Mark with `!` or footer\n- **Don''t ignore CI** - Validate commits in pipeline\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/)\n- [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/)\n- [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/)\n- [semantic-release](https://semantic-release.gitbook.io/)\n- [git-cliff](https://git-cliff.org/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T15:14:04.200Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated changelog generation and release note management.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化变更日志生成和发布说明管理的开发代理。","ja":"自動化された変更ログの生成とリリースノートの管理が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동화된 변경 로그 생성 및 릴리스 노트 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan generación automática de registros de cambios y administración de notas de lanzamiento.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une génération automatisée de journal des modifications et de gestion des notes de version.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Änderungsprotokollgenerierung und Release-Notizverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Development Agents que necessitam de geração automatizada de changelog e gestão de release notes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Development Agents, которым требуется автоматизированное создание changelog и управление release notes.","ar":"مثالي لـ Development Agents التي تحتاج إلى إنشاء سجل التغييرات الآلي وإدارة ملاحظات الإصدار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce the ''Keep a Changelog'' format and Conventional Commits standard, streamlining version management and semantic versioning using GitHub/GitLab release notes and standardized commit message formats.","zh":"赋予代理人执行''保持变更日志''格式和标准化提交规范的能力，简化版本管理和语义化版本控制，使用 GitHub/GitLab 发布说明和标准化的提交消息格式。","ja":"エージェントに''変更ログを保持する''形式と標準的なコミット規範を実施する能力を与え、GitHub/GitLab のリリースノートと標準化されたコミットメッセージ形式を使用してバージョン管理とセマンティックバージョニングを簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트가 ''변경 로그를保持하라'' 형식과 표준 커밋 규약을 시행할 수 있도록 하여 GitHub/GitLab 릴리스 노트 및 표준화된 커밋 메시지 형식을 사용하여 버전 관리 및 시맨틱 버저닝을 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar el formato ''Mantener un registro de cambios'' y el estándar Conventional Commits, simplificando la administración de versiones y la versión semántica utilizando notas de lanzamiento de GitHub/GitLab y formatos de mensajes de confirmación estandarizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer le format ''Garder un journal des modifications'' et la norme Conventional Commits, simplifiant ainsi la gestion des versions et la version sémantique à l''aide de notes de version GitHub/GitLab et de formats de messages de validation standardisés.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, das ''Keep a Changelog''-Format und den Conventional Commits-Standard durchzusetzen, wodurch die Versionsverwaltung und die semantische Versionierung mithilfe von GitHub/GitLab-Release-Notes und standardisierten Commit-Nachrichtenformaten rationalisiert wird.","pt":"Capacita os agents a impor o formato ''Keep a Changelog'' e o padrão Conventional Commits, simplificando o gerenciamento de versões e semantic versioning usando GitHub/GitLab release notes e formatos de mensagem de commit padronizados.","ru":"Позволяет agents применять формат ''Keep a Changelog'' и стандарт Conventional Commits, упрощая управление версиями и semantic versioning с использованием GitHub/GitLab release notes и стандартизированных форматов сообщений коммитов.","ar":"يمكن الـ agents من فرض تنسيق ''Keep a Changelog'' ومعيار Conventional Commits، مما يبسط إدارة الإصدارات والـ semantic versioning باستخدام ملاحظات إصدار GitHub/GitLab وتنسيقات رسائل الالتزام الموحدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating changelog generation for improved version control","Implementing Conventional Commits for consistent commit message formatting","Generating GitHub/GitLab release notes for efficient release management","Standardizing commit message formats for enhanced collaboration","Managing semantic versioning for accurate version tracking"],"zh":["自动化变更日志生成以改善版本控制","实施标准化提交以保持一致的提交消息格式","生成 GitHub/GitLab 发布说明以实现高效的发布管理","标准化提交消息格式以增强协作","管理语义化版本以实现准确的版本跟踪"],"ja":["バージョン管理の改善のために変更ログの自動生成","一貫したコミットメッセージ形式を保持するための標準的なコミットの実施","効率的なリリース管理のための GitHub/GitLab リリースノートの生成","コラボレーションの強化のためのコミットメッセージ形式の標準化","正確なバージョントラッキングのためのセマンティックバージョニングの管理"],"ko":["버전에 대한 관리를 개선하기 위한 자동화된 변경 로그 생성","일관된 커밋 메시지 형식을 유지하기 위한 표준 커밋 규약의 구현","효율적인 릴리스 관리를 위한 GitHub/GitLab 릴리스 노트 생성","협력을 강화하기 위한 커밋 메시지 형식의 표준화","정확한 버전 추적을 위한 시맨틱 버저닝 관리"],"es":["Automatizar la generación de registros de cambios para un mejor control de versiones","Implementar Conventional Commits para un formato de mensaje de confirmación coherente","Generar notas de lanzamiento de GitHub/GitLab para una administración de lanzamientos eficiente","Establecer formatos de mensajes de confirmación estandarizados para una colaboración mejorada","Administrar la versión semántica para un seguimiento de versiones preciso"],"fr":["Automatiser la génération du journal des modifications pour un meilleur contrôle des versions","Mettre en œuvre Conventional Commits pour un formatage cohérent des messages de validation","Générer des notes de version GitHub/GitLab pour une gestion de version efficace","Normaliser les formats de messages de validation pour une collaboration améliorée","Gérer la version sémantique pour un suivi de version précis"],"de":["Automatisierung der Änderungsprotokollgenerierung für eine verbesserte Versionskontrolle","Implementierung von Conventional Commits für ein konsistentes Commit-Nachrichtenformat","Generierung von GitHub/GitLab-Release-Notes für eine effiziente Release-Verwaltung","Standardisierung von Commit-Nachrichtenformaten für eine verbesserte Zusammenarbeit","Verwaltung der semantischen Versionierung für eine genaue Versionsverfolgung"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de changelog para um controle de versão melhorado","Implementar Conventional Commits para uma formatação consistente de mensagens de commit","Gerar GitHub/GitLab release notes para uma gestão de lançamentos eficiente","Padronizar formatos de mensagens de commit para uma colaboração aprimorada","Gerenciar semantic versioning para um rastreamento preciso de versões"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания changelog для улучшенного контроля версий","Внедрение Conventional Commits для единообразного форматирования сообщений коммитов","Создание GitHub/GitLab release notes для эффективного управления выпусками","Стандартизация форматов сообщений коммитов для улучшенного collaboration","Управление semantic versioning для точного отслеживания версий"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء سجل التغييرات لتحسين التحكم في الإصدار","تنفيذ Conventional Commits لتنسيق متسق لرسائل الالتزام","إنشاء ملاحظات إصدار GitHub/GitLab لإدارة إصدار فعالة","توحيد تنسيقات رسائل الالتزام لتعزيز التعاون","إدارة الـ semantic versioning لتتبع دقيق للإصدارات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to ''Keep a Changelog'' format and Conventional Commits standard","Limited to GitHub/GitLab release notes integration","Semantic versioning management requires consistent commit messaging"],"zh":["需要遵守''保持变更日志''格式和标准化提交规范","仅限于 GitHub/GitLab 发布说明集成","语义化版本管理需要一致的提交消息"],"ja":["''変更ログを保持する''形式と標準的なコミット規範に従う必要がある","GitHub/GitLab リリースノートの統合に限定される","セマンティックバージョニングの管理には一貫したコミットメッセージが必要"],"ko":["''변경 로그를 유지하라'' 형식 및 표준 커밋 규약을 따라야 함","GitHub/GitLab 릴리스 노트 통합에 제한됨","시맨틱 버저닝 관리에는 일관된 커밋 메시지가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere la adhesión al formato ''Mantener un registro de cambios'' y al estándar Conventional Commits","Limitado a la integración de notas de lanzamiento de GitHub/GitLab","La administración de la versión semántica requiere un mensaje de confirmación coherente"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion au format ''Garder un journal des modifications'' et à la norme Conventional Commits","Limité à l''intégration des notes de version GitHub/GitLab","La gestion de la version sémantique nécessite un message de validation cohérent"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des ''Keep a Changelog''-Formats und des Conventional Commits-Standards","Begrenzt auf die Integration von GitHub/GitLab-Release-Notes","Die Verwaltung der semantischen Versionierung erfordert konsistente Commit-Nachrichten"],"pt":["Requer adesão ao formato ''Keep a Changelog'' e ao padrão Conventional Commits","Limitado à integração com GitHub/GitLab release notes","O gerenciamento de semantic versioning requer mensagens de commit consistentes"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения формата ''Keep a Changelog'' и стандарта Conventional Commits","Ограничено интеграцией с GitHub/GitLab release notes","Управление semantic versioning требует последовательных сообщений коммитов"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بتنسيق ''Keep a Changelog'' ومعيار Conventional Commits","يقتصر على التكامل مع ملاحظات إصدار GitHub/GitLab","إدارة الـ semantic versioning تتطلب رسائل التزام متسقة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"3b5fc90d13fa54918da996f84920eeb233efdb597decd77728f4c2d1d84049e6","qualityScore":60}');
