alizado: Guía de Configuración","fr":"Générateur de CV sur Mesure: Meilleures Pratiques","de":"Individueller Lebenslauf-Generator: Einrichtungsanleitung","pt":"Guia de Configuração do Gerador de Currículos Personalizados","ru":"Настройка индивидуального генератора резюме ИИ Агенты","ar":"دليل إعداد جهاز توليد السيرة الذاتية المخصص"},"description":{"en":"Discover how tailored-resume-generator analyzes job descriptions to create customized resumes. Get started with our setup guide and optimize your resume for ...","zh":"使用个性化简历生成器，根据工作描述定制简历，突出相关经验，优化申请者追踪系统","ja":"カスタムResume生成ツールを使用して、求人情報に基づいて簡历をカスタマイズし、関連する経験を強調し、応募者追跡システムを最適化します","ko":"맞춤형 이력서 생성기를 사용하여 일자리 설명에 따라 이력서를 맞춤설정하고 관련 경험을 강조하며 지원자 추적 시스템을 최적화합니다","es":"Aprende a utilizar el generador de resumen personalizado para crear CVs óptimos para sistemas de seguimiento de solicitudes y aumentar tus posibilidades de s...","fr":"Découvrez comment utiliser le générateur de CV sur mesure pour créer des CV optimisés pour les systèmes de suivi des candidatures et augmenter vos chances d''...","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie den individuellen Lebenslauf-Generator nutzen können, um optimale Lebensläufe für Bewerber-Tracking-Systeme zu erstellen und Ihre Chanc...","pt":"Aprenda a criar currículos personalizados para vagas específicas com o gerador de currículos personalizados, otimizando para sistemas de rastreamento de cand...","ru":"Создайте индивидуальные резюме для конкретных вакансий с помощью генератора резюме ИИ Агенты, оптимизируя для систем отслеживания заявок","ar":"تعلم كيفية إنشاء سير ذاتية مخصصة للوظائف المحددة باستخدام جهاز توليد السيرة الذاتية المخصص، مع تحسينها لبرامج تتبع الطلبات"},"definition":{"en":"tailored-resume-generator is a skill that generates customized resumes by analyzing job descriptions and extracting key requirements, skills, and qualifications.","zh":"个性化简历生成器是一种AIエージェント，根据工作描述生成定制简历","ja":"カスタムResume生成ツールは、求人情報に基づいて簡历をカスタマイズするAIエージェントの一種です","ko":"맞춤형 이력서 생성기는 일자리 설명에 따라 이력서를 맞춤설정하는 AI 에이전트의 한 종류입니다","es":"Un generador de resumen personalizado es una herramienta de inteligencia artificial que crea CVs personalizados para diferentes puestos y sectores","fr":"Un générateur de CV sur mesure est un outil d''intelligence artificielle qui crée des CV personnalisés pour différents postes et secteurs","de":"Ein individueller Lebenslauf-Generator ist ein KI-Tool, das individuelle Lebensläufe für verschiedene Stellen und Branchen erstellt","pt":"O que é um gerador de currículos personalizados? É uma ferramenta que cria currículos personalizados com base em descrições de vagas","ru":"Что такое генератор резюме ИИ Агенты? Это инструмент, создающий индивидуальные резюме на основе описаний вакансий","ar":"ما هو جهاز توليد السيرة الذاتية المخصص? هو أداة tạo سير ذاتية مخصصة بناءً على وصفات الوظائف"},"features":{"en":["Analyzes Job Descriptions to extract key requirements and skills","Customizes resumes for different industries or roles","Highlights relevant experience for career transitions","Optimizes resumes for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)","Creates multiple resume versions for different job applications","Emphasizes specific skills mentioned in job postings"],"zh":["根据工作描述分析和提取关键要求","生成定制简历以提高申请成功率","优化申请者追踪系统","突出相关经验","支持多种简历版本","强调特定技能"],"ja":["求人情報を分析して重要な要件を抽出","カスタマイズされた簡历を生成して応募成功率を高める","応募者追跡システムを最適化","関連する経験を強調","複数の簡历バージョンをサポート","特定のスキルを強調"],"ko":["일자리 설명을 분석하여 핵심 요구사항을 추출","맞춤형 이력서를 생성하여 지원 성공률을 높임","지원자 추적 시스템을 최적화","관련 경험을 강조","여러 이력서 버전을 지원","특정 스킬을 강조"],"es":["Análisis de descripciones de trabajo para extraer requisitos clave","Creación de CVs personalizados para diferentes puestos y sectores","Optimización para sistemas de seguimiento de solicitudes","Resaltado de habilidades relevantes para transiciones de carrera","Creación de múltiples versiones de CV para diferentes solicitudes de trabajo"],"fr":["Analyse des descriptions de travail pour extraire les exigences clés","Création de CV personnalisés pour différents postes et secteurs","Optimisation pour les systèmes de suivi des candidatures","Mise en avant des compétences pertinentes pour les transitions de carrière","Création de plusieurs versions de CV pour différentes candidatures"],"de":["Analyse von Stellenbeschreibungen, um wichtige Anforderungen zu extrahieren","Erstellung individueller Lebensläufe für verschiedene Stellen und Branchen","Optimierung für Bewerber-Tracking-Systeme","Hervorhebung relevanter Fähigkeiten für Karrierewechsel","Erstellung mehrerer Lebenslaufversionen für verschiedene Bewerbungen"],"pt":["Análise de descrições de vagas para extração de requisitos-chave","Criação de currículos personalizados para vagas específicas","Otimização para sistemas de rastreamento de candidatos","Destaque de experiências relevantes para transições de carreira","Criação de múltiplas versões de currículos para diferentes aplicações"],"ru":["Анализ описаний вакансий для извлечения ключевых требований","Создание индивидуальных резюме для конкретных вакансий","Оптимизация для систем отслеживания заявок","Подчеркивание релевантного опыта для карьерных переходов","Создание нескольких версий резюме для разных заявок"],"ar":["تحليل وصفات الوظائف لاستخراج المتطلبات الرئيسية","إنشاء سير ذاتية مخصصة للوظائف المحددة","تحسين البرامج لتتبع الطلبات","التأكيد على الخبرات ذات الصلة للتحولات الوظيفية","إنشاء نسخ متعددة من السيرة الذاتية لتطبيقات مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use tailored-resume-generator","what is tailored-resume-generator","tailored-resume-generator alternative","tailored-resume-generator vs resume builder","tailored-resume-generator install","tailored-resume-generator setup guide","customized resume creation","ATS optimized resumes","job description analysis"],"zh":["个性化简历生成器","AIエージェント","简历定制","工作描述分析","申请者追踪系统","相关经验","简历版本","特定技能"],"ja":["カスタムResume生成ツール","AIエージェント","簡历カスタマイズ","求人情報分析","応募者追跡システム","関連する経験","簡历バージョン","特定のスキル"],"ko":["맞춤형 이력서 생성기","AI 에이전트","이력서 맞춤설정","일자리 설명 분석","지원자 추적 시스템","관련 경험","이력서 버전","특정 스킬"],"es":["generador de resumen personalizado","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para empleo","optimización de CV para ATS","creación de CV personalizados","transiciones de carrera","búsqueda de empleo","desarrollo de carrera"],"fr":["générateur de CV sur mesure","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour l''emploi","optimisation de CV pour les systèmes de suivi des candidatures","création de CV personnalisés","transitions de carrière","recherche d''emploi","développement de carrière"],"de":["individueller Lebenslauf-Generator","KI-Tools für die Jobsuche","Optimierung von Lebensläufen für Bewerber-Tracking-Systeme","Erstellung individueller Lebensläufe","Karrierewechsel","Stellensuche","Karriereentwicklung"],"pt":["gerador de currículos personalizados","currículos personalizados","sistemas de rastreamento de candidatos","transições de carreira","otimização de currículos","criação de currículos","descrições de vagas","requisitos-chave"],"ru":["генератор резюме ИИ Агенты","индивидуальные резюме","системы отслеживания заявок","карьерные переходы","оптимизация резюме","создание резюме","описания вакансий","ключевые требования"],"ar":["جهاز توليد السيرة الذاتية المخصص","سير ذاتية مخصصة","برامج تتبع الطلبات","تحولات وظيفية","تحسين السيرة الذاتية","إنشاء السيرة الذاتية","وصفات الوظائف","المتطلبات الرئيسية"]}},"owner":"QuyDatSadBoy","repo":"Agent-skill","repoPath":"QuyDatSadBoy/Agent-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T01:49:01.718Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailored-resume-generator","description":"Analyzes job descriptions and generates tailored resumes that highlight relevant experience, skills, and achievements to maximize interview chances","bodyPreview":"# Tailored Resume Generator\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Applying for a specific job position\n- Customizing your resume for different industries or roles\n- Highlighting relevant experience for career transitions\n- Optimizing your resume for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)\n- Creating multiple resume versions for different job applications\n- Emphasizing specific skills mentioned in job postings\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes Job Descriptions**: Extracts key requirements, skills, qualifi","body":"# Tailored Resume Generator\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Applying for a specific job position\n- Customizing your resume for different industries or roles\n- Highlighting relevant experience for career transitions\n- Optimizing your resume for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)\n- Creating multiple resume versions for different job applications\n- Emphasizing specific skills mentioned in job postings\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes Job Descriptions**: Extracts key requirements, skills, qualifications, and keywords from job postings\n2. **Identifies Priorities**: Determines what employers value most based on the job description language and structure\n3. **Tailors Content**: Reorganizes and emphasizes relevant experience, skills, and achievements\n4. **Optimizes Keywords**: Incorporates ATS-friendly keywords naturally throughout the resume\n5. **Formats Professionally**: Creates clean, professional resume layouts suitable for various formats\n6. **Provides Recommendations**: Suggests improvements and highlights gaps to address\n\n## How to Use\n\n### Basic Usage\nProvide a job description and your background information:\n\n```\nI''m applying for this job:\n\n[paste job description]\n\nHere''s my background:\n- 5 years as software engineer at TechCorp\n- Led team of 3 developers on mobile app project\n- Expert in Python, JavaScript, React\n- Computer Science degree from State University\n```\n\n### With Existing Resume\nUpload or paste your current resume along with the job description:\n\n```\nPlease tailor my resume for this position:\n\nJob Description:\n[paste job description]\n\nMy Current Resume:\n[paste resume content]\n```\n\n### Career Transition\nWhen changing industries or roles:\n\n```\nI''m transitioning from marketing to product management.\nHere''s the job I''m applying for:\n\n[paste job description]\n\nMy transferable experience:\n- 7 years in digital marketing\n- Led cross-functional teams\n- Managed product launches\n- Data analysis and A/B testing\n```\n\n## Example\n\n**User Request:**\n```\nI need a tailored resume for this job:\n\nSenior Data Analyst Position\n\nRequirements:\n- 5+ years experience in data analysis\n- Expert in SQL, Python, and data visualization tools\n- Experience with A/B testing and statistical analysis\n- Strong communication skills to present findings\n- Healthcare industry experience preferred\n\nMy background:\n- Data Analyst at RetailCo (2019-2024)\n- Created dashboards using Tableau and Power BI\n- Built Python scripts for data automation\n- Worked with marketing team on campaign analysis\n- Business Analytics degree\n- Also did 1 year internship at HealthPlus clinic\n```\n\n**Generated Output:**\n\n```markdown\n# JOHN DOE\nEmail: john.doe@email.com | Phone: (555) 123-4567 | LinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/johndoe\n\n## PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\nResults-driven Data Analyst with 5+ years of experience leveraging SQL, Python, and advanced\nvisualization tools to deliver actionable insights. Proven track record in statistical analysis,\nA/B testing, and cross-functional collaboration. Healthcare industry experience with strong\nability to communicate complex data findings to stakeholders.\n\n## TECHNICAL SKILLS\n- **Data Analysis & Programming**: SQL, Python, Statistical Analysis, A/B Testing\n- **Visualization Tools**: Tableau, Power BI, Advanced Dashboard Development\n- **Data Management**: Data Automation, ETL Processes, Database Optimization\n- **Business Intelligence**: Campaign Analytics, Performance Metrics, KPI Tracking\n\n## PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\n\n**Data Analyst** | RetailCo | 2019 - 2024\n- Designed and implemented 50+ SQL queries and Python automation scripts, reducing manual\n  data processing time by 60%\n- Conducted rigorous A/B testing and statistical analysis for marketing campaigns,\n  improving campaign ROI by 35%\n- Built interactive Tableau and Power BI dashboards for executive team, enabling\n  data-driven decision making\n- Presented analytical findings to cross-functional stakeholders including marketing,\n  operations, and executive leadership\n- Collaborated with marketing team to analyze customer behavior patterns and optimize\n  targeting strategies\n\n**Data Analysis Intern** | HealthPlus Clinic | 2018 - 2019\n- Supported healthcare analytics initiatives by analyzing patient data and operational metrics\n- Gained exposure to healthcare industry data management and HIPAA compliance requirements\n- Assisted in creating reports for clinical staff to improve patient care workflows\n\n## EDUCATION\n\n**Bachelor of Science in Business Analytics**\nState University | Graduated 2018\n\n## KEY ACHIEVEMENTS\n- Reduced data processing time by 60% through Python automation\n- Improved marketing campaign ROI by 35% through A/B testing and optimization\n- Created data visualization system now used across entire organization\n```\n\n**Additional Recommendations:**\n- Consider adding any specific healthcare projects or certifications\n- Quantify more achievements with metrics when possible\n- If you have experience with R or advanced statistical methods, add them\n- Consider mentioning any familiarity with healthcare regulations (HIPAA, etc.)\n\n---\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen a user requests resume tailoring:\n\n### 1. Gather Information\n\n**Job Description Analysis**:\n- Request the full job description if not provided\n- Ask for the company name and job title\n\n**Candidate Background**:\n- If user provides existing resume, use it as the foundation\n- If not, request:\n  - Work history (job titles, companies, dates, responsibilities)\n  - Education background\n  - Key skills and technical proficiencies\n  - Notable achievements and metrics\n  - Certifications or awards\n  - Any other relevant information\n\n### 2. Analyze Job Requirements\n\nExtract and prioritize:\n- **Must-have qualifications**: Years of experience, required skills, education\n- **Key skills**: Technical tools, methodologies, competencies\n- **Soft skills**: Communication, leadership, teamwork\n- **Industry knowledge**: Domain-specific experience\n- **Keywords**: Repeated terms, phrases, and buzzwords for ATS optimization\n- **Company values**: Cultural fit indicators from job description\n\nCreate a mental map of:\n- Priority 1: Critical requirements (deal-breakers)\n- Priority 2: Important qualifications (strongly desired)\n- Priority 3: Nice-to-have skills (bonus points)\n\n### 3. Map Candidate Experience to Requirements\n\nFor each job requirement:\n- Identify matching experience from candidate''s background\n- Find transferable skills if no direct match\n- Note gaps that need to be addressed or de-emphasized\n- Identify unique strengths to highlight\n\n### 4. Structure the Tailored Resume\n\n**Professional Summary** (3-4 lines):\n- Lead with years of experience in the target role/field\n- Include top 3-4 required skills from job description\n- Mention industry experience if relevant\n- Highlight unique value proposition\n\n**Technical/Core Skills Section**:\n- Group skills by category matching job requirements\n- List required tools and technologies first\n- Use exact terminology from job description\n- Only include skills you can substantiate with experience\n\n**Professional Experience**:\n- For each role, emphasize responsibilities and achievements aligned with job requirements\n- Use action verbs: Led, Developed, Implemented, Optimized, Managed, Created, Analyzed\n- **Quantify achievements**: Include numbers, percentages, timeframes, scale\n- Reorder bullet points to prioritize most relevant experience\n- Use keywords naturally from job description\n- Format: **[Action Verb] + [What] + [How/Why] + [Result/Impact]**\n\n**Education**:\n- List degrees, certifications relevant to position\n- Include relevant coursework if early career\n- Add certifications that match job requirements\n\n**Optional Sections** (if applicable):\n- Certifications & Licenses\n- Publications or Speaking Engagements\n- Awards & Recognition\n- Volunteer Work (if relevant to role)\n- Projects (especially for technical roles)\n\n### 5. Optimize for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)\n\n- Use standard section headings (Professional Experience, Education, Skills)\n- Incorporate exact keywords from job description naturally\n- Avoid tables, graphics, headers/footers, or complex formatting\n- Use standard fonts and bullet points\n- Include both acronyms and full terms (e.g., \"SQL (Structured Query Language)\")\n- Match job title terminology where truthful\n\n### 6. Format and Present\n\n**Format Options**:\n- **Markdown**: Clean, readable, easy to copy\n- **Plain Text**: ATS-optimized, safe for all systems\n- **Tips for Word/PDF**: Provide formatting guidance\n\n**Resume Structure Guidelines**:\n- Keep to 1 page for <10 years experience, 2 pages for 10+ years\n- Use consistent formatting and spacing\n- Ensure contact information is prominent\n- Use reverse chronological order (most recent first)\n- Maintain clean, scannable layout with white space\n\n### 7. Provide Strategic Recommendations\n\nAfter presenting the tailored resume, offer:\n\n**Strengths Analysis**:\n- What makes this candidate competitive\n- Unique qualifications to emphasize in cover letter or interview\n\n**Gap Analysis**:\n- Requirements not fully met\n- Suggestions for addressing gaps (courses, projects, reframing experience)\n\n**Interview Preparation Tips**:\n- Key talking points aligned with resume\n- Stories to prepare based on job requirements\n- Questions to ask that demonstrate fit\n\n**Cover Letter Hooks**:\n- Suggest 2-3 opening lines for cover letter\n- Key achievements to expand upon\n\n### 8. Iterate and Refine\n\nAsk if user wants to:\n- Adjust emphasis or tone\n- Add or remove sections\n- Generate alternative versions for different roles\n- Create format variations (traditional vs. modern)\n- Develop role-specific versions (if applying to multiple similar positions)\n\n### 9. Best Practices to Follow\n\n**Do**:\n- Be truthful and accurate - never fabricate experience\n- Use industry-standard terminology\n- Quantify achievements with specific metrics\n- Tailor each resume to specific job\n- Proofread for grammar and consistency\n- Keep language concise and impactful\n\n**Don''t**:\n- Include personal information (age, marital status, photo unless requested)\n- Use first-person pronouns (I, me, my)\n- Include references (\"available upon request\" is outdated)\n- List every job if career is 20+ years (focus on relevant, recent experience)\n- Use generic templates without customization\n- Exceed 2 pages unless very senior role\n\n### 10. Special Considerations\n\n**Career Changers**:\n- Use functional or hybrid resume format\n- Emphasize transferable skills\n- Create compelling narrative in summary\n- Focus on relevant projects and coursework\n\n**Recent Graduates**:\n- Lead with education\n- Include relevant coursework, projects, internships\n- Emphasize leadership in student organizations\n- Include GPA if 3.5+\n\n**Senior Executives**:\n- Lead with executive summary\n- Focus on leadership and strategic impact\n- Include board memberships, speaking engagements\n- Emphasize revenue growth, team building, vision\n\n**Technical Roles**:\n- Include technical skills section prominently\n- List programming languages, frameworks, tools\n- Include GitHub, portfolio, or project links\n- Mention methodologies (Agile, Scrum, etc.)\n\n**Creative Roles**:\n- Include link to portfolio\n- Highlight creative achievements and campaigns\n- Mention tools and software proficiencies\n- Consider more creative formatting (while maintaining ATS compatibility)\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\n- **Be specific**: Provide complete job descriptions and detailed background information\n- **Share metrics**: Include numbers, percentages, and quantifiable achievements when describing your experience\n- **Indicate format preference**: Let the skill know if you need ATS-optimized, creative, or traditional format\n- **Mention constraints**: Share any specific requirements (page limits, sections to include/exclude)\n- **Iterate**: Don''t hesitate to ask for revisions or alternative approaches\n- **Multiple applications**: Generate separate tailored versions for different roles\n\n## Privacy Note\n\nThis skill processes your personal and professional information to generate tailored resumes. Always review the output before submitting to ensure accuracy and appropriateness. Remove or modify any information you prefer not to share with potential employers.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T02:45:44.682Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Career Counseling Agents needing advanced resume customization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级简历自定义功能的职业咨询代理","ja":"高度な履歴書カスタマイズ機能を必要とするキャリアカウンセリングエージェントに最適","ko":"진급된 이력서 커스터마이징 기능을 필요로 하는 경력 상담 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de asesoramiento profesional que necesitan capacidades de personalización de currículum avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de conseil en carrière ayant besoin de capacités de personnalisation de curriculum vitae avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Karriereberatungsagenten, die erweiterte Lebenslaufanpassungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Orientação de Carreira que precisam de capacidades avançadas de personalização de currículos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по карьерному консультированию, которым необходимы расширенные возможности настройки резюме.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إرشاد المسار الوظيفي التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات مخصصة متقدمة لتحديث السيرة الذاتية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate tailored resumes by analyzing job descriptions, extracting key requirements, and highlighting relevant experience using Natural Language Processing (NLP) and Applicant Tracking System (ATS) optimization techniques.","zh":"通过自然语言处理（NLP）和申请人跟踪系统（ATS）优化技术，分析工作描述、提取关键要求、突出相关经验，赋予代理生成定制化简历的能力","ja":"自然言語処理（NLP）およびアプリケント・トラッキング・システム（ATS）最適化技術を使用して、仕事の説明を分析し、重要な要件を抽出し、関連する経験を強調し、エージェントがカスタマイズされた履歴書を生成する機能を提供する","ko":"자연어 처리(NLP)와 지원자 추적 시스템(ATS) 최적화 기술을 사용하여 업무 설명을 분석하고 핵심 요구 사항을 추출하며 관련 경험을 강조하여 에이전트가 맞춤형 이력서를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar currículums personalizados analizando descripciones de trabajo, extrayendo requisitos clave y destacando experiencia relevante utilizando técnicas de Procesamiento de Lenguaje Natural (NLP) y optimización del Sistema de Seguimiento de Solicitantes (ATS).","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des curriculum vitae personnalisés en analysant les descriptions de poste, en extrayant les exigences clés et en mettant en évidence l''expérience pertinente en utilisant des techniques de Traitement du Langage Naturel (NLP) et d''optimisation du Système de Suivi des Candidats (ATS).","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, maßgeschneiderte Lebensläufe zu erstellen, indem sie Stellenbeschreibungen analysieren, Schlüsselanforderungen extrahieren und relevante Erfahrungen mithilfe von Techniken des Natural Language Processing (NLP) und der Optimierung des Bewerberverfolgungssystems (ATS) hervorheben.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar currículos personalizados analisando descrições de trabalho, extrair requisitos-chave e destacar experiências relevantes usando técnicas de Processamento de Linguagem Natural (NLP) e otimização do Sistema de Rastreamento de Candidatos (ATS).","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать индивидуальные резюме путем анализа описаний вакансий, извлечения ключевых требований и подчеркивания соответствующего опыта с использованием методов обработки естественного языка (NLP) и оптимизации системы отслеживания заявок (ATS).","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من توليد سير ذاتية مخصصة من خلال تحليل وصفات العمل وتحديد المتطلبات الأساسية والتأكيد على الخبرات ذات الصلة باستخدام تقنيات معالجة اللغة الطبيعية (NLP) وتحسين نظام تتبع المتقدمين (ATS)."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating resume generation for specific job positions","Customizing resumes for different industries or roles","Optimizing resumes for ATS compatibility"],"zh":["为特定工作岗位自动化生成简历","为不同行业或角色自定义简历","优化简历以适应ATS兼容性"],"ja":["特定の仕事のポジションのための履歴書の自動生成","異なる業界または役割のための履歴書のカスタマイズ","ATSとの互換性を向上させるための履歴書の最適化"],"ko":["특정 업무 포지션을 위한 이력서 자동 생성","다른 산업 또는 역할을 위한 이력서 맞춤화","ATS 호환성을 위한 이력서 최적화"],"es":["Automatizar la generación de currículums para puestos de trabajo específicos","Personalizar currículums para diferentes industrias o roles","Optimizar currículums para la compatibilidad con el ATS"],"fr":["Automatiser la génération de curriculum vitae pour des postes spécifiques","Personnaliser les curriculum vitae pour différentes industries ou rôles","Optimiser les curriculum vitae pour la compatibilité avec le Système de Suivi des Candidats (ATS)"],"de":["Automatisierung der Lebenslaugerstellung für bestimmte Stellen","Anpassung von Lebensläufen an verschiedene Branchen oder Rollen","Optimierung von Lebensläufen für die Kompatibilität mit dem Bewerberverfolgungssystem (ATS)"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de currículos para cargos específicos","Personalizar currículos para diferentes indústrias ou funções","Otimizar currículos para compatibilidade com o ATS"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию резюме для конкретных вакансий","Настроить резюме для различных отраслей или ролей","Оптимизировать резюме для совместимости с ATS"],"ar":["أتمتة توليد السير الذاتية لمواقع العمل المحددة","تخصيص السير الذاتية لمختلف الصناعات أو الأدوار","تحسين السير الذاتية للتوافق مع نظام تتبع المتقدمين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires job description data","Limited to resume generation for specific job positions"],"zh":["需要工作描述数据","仅限于特定工作岗位的简历生成"],"ja":["仕事の説明データが必要","特定の仕事のポジションのための履歴書の生成に限定"],"ko":["업무 설명 데이터가 필요","특정 업무 포지션을 위한 이력서 생성으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere datos de descripciones de trabajo","Limitado a la generación de currículums para puestos de trabajo específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite des données de descriptions de poste","Limité à la génération de curriculum vitae pour des postes spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Stellenbeschreibungsdaten","Begrenzt auf die Lebenslaugerstellung für bestimmte Stellen"],"pt":["Exige dados de descrição de trabalho","Limitado à geração de currículos para cargos específicos"],"ru":["Требует данных о описании вакансии","Ограничен генерацией резюме для конкретных вакансий"],"ar":["يتطلب بيانات وصف العمل","محدود بتوليد السير الذاتية لمواقع العمل المحددة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7a64d9aa79a21a24f50c90a10d1a30f3c8a686d4869648e976ef69a784ba16e6","qualityScore":60}');
