toire"],"de":["Benötigt ein bestehendes Projektverzeichnis","Muss dem obligatorischen Ausführungsprotokoll folgen"],"pt":["Exige diretório de projeto existente","Deve seguir protocolo de execução obrigatório"],"ru":["Требует существующей директории проекта","Должно следовать обязательному протоколу выполнения"],"ar":["يتطلب دليل مشروع موجود","يجب اتباع بروتوكول التنفيذ الإلزامي"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"73d95a4c8157e14a1afecbd1b6e87d7ebd921e66b9fe8ceab2dcdbb36c7cae20","qualityScore":60}');
DELETE FROM skills_fts WHERE id = 'clearclown/claude-code-aida-red/aida:fix';
INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('clearclown/claude-code-aida-red/aida:fix', 'aida:fix', 'clearclown', 'claude-code-aida-red', 'community', 'aida:fix clearclown claude-code-aida-red community aida:fix is a skill that fixes existing projects to meet all 19 quality gates, benefiting developers who need to validate and repair their projects. It takes an existing project and fixes it to pass all quality gates. AIDA Fix是一种自动化工具，帮助开发者修复项目以满足19个质量门槛。它可以检查项目目录、后端和前端代码 AIDA Fixは、開発者がプロジェクトを19の品質ゲートに適合させるために修復することを支援する自動化ツールです。プロジェクトディレクトリ、バックエンド、フロントエンドコードをチェックします AIDA Fix는 개발자가 프로젝트를 19개의 품질 게이트에 맞춰 수정하도록 도와주는 자동화 도구입니다. 프로젝트 디렉토리, 백엔드, 프론트엔드 코드를 확인합니다 Aida:fix es una herramienta que soluciona proyectos existentes para cumplir con las 19 puertas de calidad Aida:fix est un outil qui résout les projets existants pour atteindre les 19 portes de qualité Aida:fix ist ein Tool, das bestehende Projekte löst, um die 19 Qualitätsprüfungen zu bestehen O aida:fix é uma ferramenta de IA que corrige projetos para atender aos 19 portais de qualidade. Use a linha de comando para validar e corrigir projetos aida:fix - это инструмент ИИ, который исправляет проекты, чтобы удовлетворить 19 качественным воротам. Используйте командную строку для проверки и исправления проектов aida:fix هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تصحيح المشاريع لتلبية 19 بوابة جودة. استخدم سطر الأوامر للتحقق من صحة المشاريع وتصحيحها how to use aida:fix aida:fix setup guide what is aida:fix aida:fix alternative aida:fix vs project validation tools aida:fix install aida:fix project repair quality gate validation project validation tools AIDA Fix 自动化项目质量检查 质量门槛 CLI命令行工具 项目质量改善 AI工具 开发者工具 Validates project existence using bash commands like ls -la ./ Repairs projects to pass all 19 quality gates Uses the /aida:fix <project-name> command for execution Supports project directory checking for backend and frontend Follows a mandatory execution protocol for quality gate validation aida:fix is a technical skill that validates and repairs existing projects to ensure they meet all 19 quality gates, using commands like /aida:fix <project-name>.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('tddworks/asc-cli/asc-cli', 'community', 'tddworks', 'asc-cli', 'tddworks/asc-cli', 'asc-cli', 44, 5, 59, '2026-03-05T16:26:10Z', '2026-03-06T06:36:27.428Z', '5515f8494fa89d806bb12532950a1e9ea9ceca7f01042f3e066da7a68b60acc6', '{"id":"tddworks/asc-cli/asc-cli","name":"asc-cli","description":{"en":"asc-cli is a Swift CLI for managing iOS and macOS apps on App Store Connect, benefiting developers and AI agents. It enables submitting versions, managing screenshots, and tracking builds","zh":"asc-cli 是一个 Swift CLI 工具，用于管理 App Store Connect。它支持提交版本、管理截图、跟踪构建，并提供 CAEOAS 代理支持","ja":"asc-cli は App Store Connect を管理するための Swift CLI ツールです。バージョンの提出、スクリーンショットの管理、ビルドの追跡、CAEOAS エージェントのサポートを提供します","ko":"asc-cli는 App Store Connect를 관리하는 Swift CLI 도구입니다. 버전 제출, 스크린샷 관리, 빌드 추적, CAEOAS 에이전트 지원을 제공합니다","es":"asc-cli es una herramienta de línea de comandos en Swift para gestionar tus apps de iOS y macOS en App Store Connect con soporte para agentes de IA","fr":"asc-cli est un outil en ligne de commande en Swift pour gérer vos applications iOS et macOS sur App Store Connect avec prise en charge des agents IA","de":"asc-cli ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool in Swift für die Verwaltung Ihrer iOS- und macOS-Apps im App Store Connect mit Unterstützung für IA-Agenten","pt":"O asc-cli é uma ferramenta de linha de comando em Swift para gerenciar apps na App Store Connect. Ele oferece suporte a autenticação persistente e gestão de builds","ru":"asc-cli — это инструмент командной строки на Swift для управления приложениями в App Store Connect. Он предлагает поддержку постоянной аутентификации и управления сборками","ar":"asc-cli هو أداة سطر الأوامر مكتوبة بلغة Swift لإدارة التطبيقات على متجر التطبيقات. يقدم دعمًا لتسجيل الدخول المستمر وإدارة الإصدارات"},"seo":{"title":{"en":"asc-cli: Setup Guide for AI Agents | AI Agent Skill","zh":"asc-cli Setup Guide: 使用 Swift CLI 管理 App Store Connect","ja":"asc-cli セットアップガイド: App Store Connect を Swift CLI で管理","ko":"asc-cli 설정 가이드: Swift CLI로 App Store Connect 관리","es":"Guía de configuración de asc-cli para App Store Connect","fr":"Guide d''installation d''asc-cli pour App Store Connect","de":"Einrichtungsanleitung für asc-cli bei App Store Connect","pt":"Guia de Configuração do asc-cli: Ferramenta de Linha de C...","ru":"Настройка asc-cli: Инструмент командной строки для App St...","ar":"دليل إعداد asc-cli: أداة سطر الأوامر لاتصال متجر التطبيقا..."},"description":{"en":"Streamline App Store Connect management with asc-cli. Learn how to authenticate and manage your iOS and macOS apps from your terminal","zh":"使用 asc-cli 管理您的 iOS 和 macOS 应用，提交版本、管理截图、跟踪构建，并支持 CAEOAS 代理","ja":"asc-cli を使用して、iOS と macOS アプリを管理します。バージョンの提出、スクリーンショットの管理、ビルドの追跡、CAEOAS エージェントのサポート","ko":"asc-cli를 사용하여 iOS 및 macOS 애플리케이션을 관리합니다. 버전 제출, 스크린샷 관리, 빌드 추적, CAEOAS 에이전트 지원","es":"Aprende a configurar asc-cli para gestionar tus apps de iOS y macOS en App Store Connect con soporte para agentes de IA","fr":"Découvrez comment configurer asc-cli pour gérer vos applications iOS et macOS sur App Store Connect avec prise en charge des agents IA","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie asc-cli für die Verwaltung Ihrer iOS- und macOS-Apps im App Store Connect mit Unterstützung für IA-Agenten einrichten","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o asc-cli para gerenciar seus apps iOS e macOS na App Store Connect com suporte a agentes de IA","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить asc-cli для управления вашими приложениями iOS и macOS в App Store Connect с поддержкой ИИ Агентов","ar":"تعرف على كيفية إعداد asc-cli لإدارة تطبيقاتك على متجر التطبيقات باستخدام أداة سطر الأوامر مع دعم الوسائط الإلكترونية الذكية"},"definition":{"en":"asc-cli is a command-line interface for App Store Connect, allowing developers to manage their apps from their terminal using Swift","zh":"asc-cli 是一个用于管理 App Store Connect 的 Swift 命令行工具","ja":"asc-cli は App Store Connect を管理するための Swift コマンドラインツール","ko":"asc-cli는 App Store Connect를 관리하는 Swift 명령줄 도구입니다","es":"asc-cli es un cliente de línea de comandos para App Store Connect que permite la gestión de apps de iOS y macOS con soporte para agentes de IA","fr":"asc-cli est un client en ligne de commande pour App Store Connect qui permet la gestion des applications iOS et macOS avec prise en charge des agents IA","de":"asc-cli ist ein Kommandozeilen-Client für App Store Connect, der die Verwaltung von iOS- und macOS-Apps mit Unterstützung für IA-Agenten ermöglicht","pt":"O que é asc-cli? É uma ferramenta de linha de comando para gerenciar apps na App Store Connect","ru":"Что такое asc-cli? Это инструмент командной строки для управления приложениями в App Store Connect","ar":"ما هو asc-cli؟ هو أداة سطر الأوامر لإدارة التطبيقات على متجر التطبيقات"},"features":{"en":["Persistent login support via authentication commands like `asc auth login`","Multiple account management with `asc auth use` and `asc auth list`","Private key management with `--private-key-path` option","Submission of app versions and management of screenshots","Tracking of builds and support for TestFlight","Full AI-agent support via CAEOAS affordances"],"zh":["提交版本和管理 App Store Connect 应用","使用 Swift CLI 管理截图和跟踪构建","支持 CAEOAS 代理和多账户管理","提供持久登录和账户切换功能","支持 TestFlight 和 IAP 功能"],"ja":["バージョンの提出と App Store Connect アプリの管理","Swift CLI を使用してスクリーンショットとビルドを管理","CAEOAS エージェントと多アカウント管理のサポート","永続的なログインとアカウントの切り替え機能","TestFlight と IAP 機能のサポート"],"ko":["버전 제출과 App Store Connect 애플리케이션 관리","Swift CLI를 사용하여 스크린샷과 빌드를 관리","CAEOAS 에이전트와 다중 계정 관리 지원","영속적 로그인과 계정 전환 기능","TestFlight와 IAP 기능 지원"],"es":["Autenticación persistente con soporte para múltiples cuentas","Gestión de versiones y capturas de pantalla para apps de iOS y macOS","Seguimiento de builds y soporte para TestFlight","Soporte para agentes de IA a través de CAEOAS","Interfaz de línea de comandos en Swift para una integración fácil"],"fr":["Authentification persistante avec prise en charge de plusieurs comptes","Gestion de versions et de captures d''écran pour les applications iOS et macOS","Suivi des builds et prise en charge de TestFlight","Prise en charge des agents IA via CAEOAS","Interface en ligne de commande en Swift pour une intégration facile"],"de":["Persistente Authentifizierung mit Unterstützung für mehrere Konten","Verwaltung von Versionen und Screenshots für iOS- und macOS-Apps","Nachverfolgung von Builds und Unterstützung für TestFlight","Unterstützung für IA-Agenten über CAEOAS","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle in Swift für eine einfache Integration"],"pt":["Autenticação persistente com suporte a múltiplas contas","Gestão de builds e versões de apps","Suporte a screenshots e gerenciamento de recursos visuais","Integração com TestFlight para testes de apps","Suporte a assinaturas e compras in-app","Desenvolvido em Swift para garantir desempenho e segurança"],"ru":["Постоянная аутентификация с поддержкой нескольких аккаунтов","Управление сборками и версиями приложений","Поддержка скриншотов и управления визуальными ресурсами","Интеграция с TestFlight для тестирования приложений","Поддержка подписок и покупок в приложении","Разработан на Swift для обеспечения производительности и безопасности"],"ar":["تسجيل الدخول المستمر مع دعم للحسابات المتعددة","إدارة الإصدارات والبنيات للتطبيقات","دعم لتحديثات الشاشة وإدارة الموارد البصرية","التكامل مع TestFlight لاختبار التطبيقات","دعم للاشتراكات والشراء داخل التطبيق","مطور بلغة Swift لضمان الأداء والأمان"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use asc-cli","asc-cli setup guide","app store connect cli","asc-cli alternative","asc-cli vs fastlane","asc-cli install","swift cli for app store connect","asc-cli authentication","app store connect management"],"zh":["asc-cli","App Store Connect","Swift CLI","CAEOAS 代理","多账户管理","提交版本","管理截图","跟踪构建","TestFlight","IAP"],"ja":["asc-cli","App Store Connect","Swift CLI","CAEOAS エージェント","多アカウント管理","バージョンの提出","スクリーンショットの管理","ビルドの追跡","TestFlight","IAP"],"ko":["asc-cli","App Store Connect","Swift CLI","CAEOAS 에이전트","다중 계정 관리","버전 제출","스크린샷 관리","빌드 추적","TestFlight","IAP"],"es":["asc-cli","App Store Connect","agentes de IA","herramientas de desarrollo","Swift","iOS","macOS","TestFlight","CAEOAS"],"fr":["asc-cli","App Store Connect","agents IA","outils de développement","Swift","iOS","macOS","TestFlight","CAEOAS"],"de":["asc-cli","App Store Connect","IA-Agenten","Entwicklungstools","Swift","iOS","macOS","TestFlight","CAEOAS"],"pt":["asc-cli","App Store Connect","ferramenta de linha de comando","gerenciamento de apps","autenticação persistente","suporte a agentes de IA","desenvolvimento de apps","Swift","TestFlight","compras in-app"],"ru":["asc-cli","App Store Connect","инструмент командной строки","управление приложениями","постоянная аутентификация","поддержка ИИ Агентов","разработка приложений","Swift","TestFlight","покупки в приложении"],"ar":["asc-cli","متجر التطبيقات","أداة سطر الأوامر","إدارة التطبيقات","تسجيل الدخول المستمر","دعم الوسائط الإلكترونية الذكية","تطوير التطبيقات","Swift","TestFlight","الشراء داخل التطبيق"]}},"owner":"tddworks","repo":"asc-cli","repoPath":"tddworks/asc-cli","stars":44,"forks":5,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T16:26:10Z","topics":["agent","appstore-connect","appstoreconnect","asccli","iap","screenshot-generator","subscriptions","swift","testflight"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"asc-cli","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# asc CLI — App Store Connect CLI\n\n## Authentication\n\n**Option A — Persistent login (recommended):**\n\n```bash\n# Single account\nasc auth login \\\n  --key-id YOUR_KEY_ID \\\n  --issuer-id YOUR_ISSUER_ID \\\n  --private-key-path ~/.asc/AuthKey_XXXXXX.p8\n\n# Multiple accounts\nasc auth login --key-id K1 --issuer-id I1 --private-key-path work.p8 --name work\nasc auth login --key-id K2 --issuer-id I2 --private-key-path personal.p8 --name personal\nasc auth use work         # switch active account\nasc auth list","body":"# asc CLI — App Store Connect CLI\n\n## Authentication\n\n**Option A — Persistent login (recommended):**\n\n```bash\n# Single account\nasc auth login \\\n  --key-id YOUR_KEY_ID \\\n  --issuer-id YOUR_ISSUER_ID \\\n  --private-key-path ~/.asc/AuthKey_XXXXXX.p8\n\n# Multiple accounts\nasc auth login --key-id K1 --issuer-id I1 --private-key-path work.p8 --name work\nasc auth login --key-id K2 --issuer-id I2 --private-key-path personal.p8 --name personal\nasc auth use work         # switch active account\nasc auth list             # see all accounts\nasc auth logout           # remove active account\nasc auth logout --name personal  # remove specific account\nasc auth check            # verify active credentials\n```\n\nCredentials are saved to `~/.asc/credentials.json`. All `asc` commands use the active account automatically. See the `asc-auth` skill for full multi-account details.\n\n**Option B — Environment variables:**\n\n```bash\nexport ASC_KEY_ID=\"YOUR_KEY_ID\"\nexport ASC_ISSUER_ID=\"YOUR_ISSUER_ID\"\nexport ASC_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH=\"~/.asc/AuthKey_XXXXXX.p8\"\n```\n\n**Resolution order:** active account in `~/.asc/credentials.json` → environment variables.\n\n---\n\n## CAEOAS — Follow the Affordances\n\nEvery response includes an `affordances` field with ready-to-run next commands. **Always use affordances** from prior responses instead of constructing commands from scratch.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": [{\n    \"id\": \"6748760927\",\n    \"name\": \"My App\",\n    \"affordances\": {\n      \"listVersions\": \"asc versions list --app-id 6748760927\"\n    }\n  }]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Command Reference\n\nSee [commands.md](references/commands.md) for full command reference with options and examples.\nSee [api_reference.md](references/api_reference.md) for the underlying App Store Connect API endpoints and error codes.\n\n### Quick reference\n\n| Goal | Command |\n|------|---------|\n| **Auth** | |\n| Save credentials to disk | `asc auth login --key-id <id> --issuer-id <id> --private-key-path <path> [--name alias]` |\n| List all saved accounts | `asc auth list` |\n| Switch active account | `asc auth use <name>` |\n| Remove an account | `asc auth logout [--name alias]` |\n| Check active credentials | `asc auth check` |\n| **Project Context** | |\n| Pin app to current directory | `asc init --app-id <id>` |\n| Find app by name | `asc init --name \"My App\"` |\n| Auto-detect from Xcode project | `asc init` |\n| **Apps & Versions** | |\n| List all apps | `asc apps list` |\n| List versions | `asc versions list --app-id <id>` |\n| Submit for review | `asc versions submit --version-id <id>` |\n| List builds | `asc builds list --app-id <id>` |\n| **Localizations** | |\n| List localizations | `asc version-localizations list --version-id <id>` |\n| Update What''s New / description | `asc version-localizations update --localization-id <id> --whats-new \"text\"` |\n| **Screenshots** | |\n| List screenshot sets | `asc screenshot-sets list --localization-id <id>` |\n| Upload screenshot | `asc screenshots upload --set-id <id> --file <path>` |\n| Import screenshot ZIP | `asc screenshots import --version-id <id> --from export.zip` |\n| **TestFlight** | |\n| TestFlight groups | `asc testflight groups list --app-id <id>` |\n| **App Info** | |\n| List app infos | `asc app-infos list --app-id <id>` |\n| List app info localizations | `asc app-info-localizations list --app-info-id <id>` |\n| Update app name/subtitle | `asc app-info-localizations update --localization-id <id> --name <n>` |\n| **In-App Purchases** | |\n| List IAPs | `asc iap list --app-id <id>` |\n| Create IAP | `asc iap create --app-id <id> --reference-name <n> --product-id <id> --type consumable` |\n| Submit IAP for review | `asc iap submit --iap-id <id>` |\n| List price points | `asc iap price-points list --iap-id <id> [--territory USA]` |\n| Set price | `asc iap prices set --iap-id <id> --base-territory USA --price-point-id <id>` |\n| IAP localizations | `asc iap-localizations list --iap-id <id>` |\n| Add IAP locale | `asc iap-localizations create --iap-id <id> --locale en-US --name <n>` |\n| **Subscriptions** | |\n| List subscription groups | `asc subscription-groups list --app-id <id>` |\n| Create subscription group | `asc subscription-groups create --app-id <id> --reference-name <n>` |\n| List subscriptions | `asc subscriptions list --group-id <id>` |\n| Create subscription | `asc subscriptions create --group-id <id> --name <n> --product-id <id> --period ONE_MONTH` |\n| Subscription localizations | `asc subscription-localizations list --subscription-id <id>` |\n| Add subscription locale | `asc subscription-localizations create --subscription-id <id> --locale en-US --name <n>` |\n\n---\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### First-time authentication setup\n\n```\n1. asc auth login --key-id <id> --issuer-id <id> --private-key-path ~/.asc/AuthKey_<id>.p8\n2. asc auth check   → confirm source: \"file\", keyID and issuerID shown\n3. asc apps list    → no env vars needed from now on\n```\n\n### Submit an app for review\n\n```\n1. asc apps list                                    → find app ID\n2. asc versions list --app-id <id>                  → find editable iOS version (PREPARE_FOR_SUBMISSION)\n   → use affordances.submitForReview if present\n3. asc versions submit --version-id <id>\n```\n\n**Prerequisite check**: `submitForReview` affordance only appears when `state` is editable. A 409 error means the version is missing required content (screenshots, build, description). Check App Store Connect UI.\n\n### Upload screenshots\n\n```\n1. asc versions list --app-id <id>                  → get version ID\n2. asc version-localizations list --version-id <id>         → get localization ID\n3. asc screenshot-sets list --localization-id <id>  → get set ID for display type\n4. asc screenshots upload --set-id <id> --file ./screenshot.png\n```\n\n### Import screenshots from ZIP (screenshot editor workflow)\n\n```\n1. Design screenshots in homepage/editor/index.html → Export ZIP\n2. asc screenshots import --version-id <id> --from ./export.zip\n```\n\n### Update app name / subtitle\n\n```\n1. asc app-infos list --app-id <id>                          → get app info ID\n2. asc app-info-localizations list --app-info-id <id>        → get localization ID\n3. asc app-info-localizations update --localization-id <id> --name \"New Name\" --subtitle \"New Subtitle\"\n```\n\n### Check build availability\n\n```\nasc builds list --app-id <id> --limit 5\n```\n\n---\n\n## Output Flags\n\n```bash\nasc apps list                    # compact JSON (default)\nasc apps list --pretty           # pretty-printed JSON\nasc apps list --output table     # table format\nasc apps list --output markdown  # markdown table\n```\n\n---\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Error | Meaning |\n|-------|---------|\n| 409 STATE_ERROR.ENTITY_STATE_INVALID | Version not ready (missing screenshots/build/metadata) |\n| 401 | Auth credentials missing or invalid |\n| 404 | Resource ID doesn''t exist or wrong type passed |\n\nWhen a submission fails with 409, inspect the version in App Store Connect web UI for missing requirements."},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:36:27.428Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for iOS and macOS Development Agents requiring streamlined App Store Connect management","zh":"适合需要简化 App Store Connect 管理的 iOS 和 macOS 开发代理","ja":"App Store Connect 管理をストリームライン化する必要がある iOS および macOS 開発エージェントに最適","ko":"App Store Connect 관리를 간소화해야 하는 iOS 및 macOS 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de iOS y macOS que requieren una gestión de App Store Connect optimizada","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement iOS et macOS nécessitant une gestion de App Store Connect rationalisée","de":"Ideal für iOS- und macOS-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine optimierte App Store Connect-Verwaltung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do iOS e macOS que exigem gestão de App Store Connect simplificada","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки iOS и macOS, требующих упрощенного управления App Store Connect","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير iOS و macOS الذي يتطلب إدارة App Store Connect مبسطة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate App Store Connect tasks using Swift CLI, enabling seamless version submissions, screenshot management, and build tracking via --key-id, --issuer-id, and --private-key-path protocols","zh":"使代理能够使用 Swift CLI 自动执行 App Store Connect 任务，从而实现版本提交、截图管理和通过 --key-id、--issuer-id 和 --private-key-path 协议进行构建跟踪","ja":"エージェントが Swift CLI を使用して App Store Connect タスクを自動化できるようにし、バージョンの提出、スクリーンショットの管理、および --key-id、--issuer-id、--private-key-path プロトコルを使用したビルドの追跡を容易にします","ko":"에이전트가 Swift CLI를 사용하여 App Store Connect 작업을 자동화할 수 있도록 하여 버전 제출, 스크린샷 관리 및 --key-id, --issuer-id 및 --private-key-path 프로토콜을 통해 빌드 추적을 원활하게 수행","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar tareas de App Store Connect utilizando Swift CLI, lo que permite envíos de versiones sin problemas, administración de captures de pantalla y seguimiento de compilaciones a través de los protocolos --key-id, --issuer-id y --private-key-path","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tâches de App Store Connect en utilisant Swift CLI, ce qui permet des soumissions de versions sans problème, une gestion des captures d''écran et un suivi des builds via les protocoles --key-id, --issuer-id et --private-key-path","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, App Store Connect-Aufgaben mithilfe von Swift CLI zu automatisieren, sodass versionssubmissions ohne Probleme, Screenshot-Verwaltung und Build-Verfolgung über die Protokolle --key-id, --issuer-id und --private-key-path ermöglicht werden","pt":"Permite que os agentes automatem tarefas do App Store Connect usando Swift CLI, permitindo a submissão de versões sem problemas, gerenciamento de telas e rastreamento de compilações via protocolos --key-id, --issuer-id e --private-key-path","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать задачи App Store Connect с помощью Swift CLI, обеспечивая бесшовную отправку версий, управление экранами и отслеживание сборок через протоколы --key-id, --issuer-id и --private-key-path","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تلقيم مهام App Store Connect باستخدام Swift CLI، وتمكين إرسال الإصدارات بسلاسة وإدارة الشاشات وتحديدSite البناء عبر بروتوكولات --key-id و --issuer-id و --private-key-path"},"useCases":{"en":["Submitting new app versions","Managing screenshots for multiple apps","Tracking and debugging builds"],"zh":["提交新应用版本","管理多个应用的截图","跟踪和调试构建"],"ja":["新しいアプリバージョンの提出","複数のアプリのスクリーンショットの管理","ビルドの追跡とデバッグ"],"ko":["새 애플리케이션 버전 제출","여러 애플리케이션의 스크린샷 관리","빌드 추적 및 디버깅"],"es":["Enviar nuevas versiones de aplicaciones","Administrar capturas de pantalla para varias aplicaciones","Seguimiento y depuración de compilaciones"],"fr":["Soumettre de nouvelles versions d''applications","Gérer les captures d''écran pour plusieurs applications","Suivi et débogage des builds"],"de":["Neue App-Versionen übermitteln","Screenshots für mehrere Apps verwalten","Builds verfolgen und debuggen"],"pt":["Enviar novas versões de aplicativos","Gerenciar telas para vários aplicativos","Rastrear e depurar compilações"],"ru":["Отправка новых версий приложений","Управление экранами для нескольких приложений","Отслеживание и отладка сборок"],"ar":["إرسال إصدارات جديدة من التطبيقات","إدارة الشاشات لمتعددة التطبيقات","تتبع Site البناء وتحديد الأخطاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires App Store Connect authentication via key-id, issuer-id, and private-key-path","Swift CLI compatibility necessary"],"zh":["需要通过 key-id、issuer-id 和 private-key-path 进行 App Store Connect 身份验证","需要 Swift CLI 兼容性"],"ja":["key-id、issuer-id、private-key-path を使用した App Store Connect 認証が必要","Swift CLI との互換性が必要"],"ko":["key-id, issuer-id 및 private-key-path를 사용한 App Store Connect 인증이 필요","Swift CLI와의 호환성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere autenticación de App Store Connect a través de key-id, issuer-id y private-key-path","Compatibilidad con Swift CLI necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification App Store Connect via key-id, issuer-id et private-key-path","Compatibilité Swift CLI nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt