lugin that provides a universal release workflow, supporting Node.js, Python, Rust, and other project types with auto-detection and customizable formulas.","zh":"Release Skills 是一个用于自动化项目发布流程的 AI エージェント工具","ja":"Release Skills はプロジェクトのリリースプロセスを自動化する AIエージェント ツールです","ko":"Release Skills는 프로젝트 릴리스 프로세스를 자동화하는 AI 도구입니다","es":"Release-skills es un plugin que permite la automatización de flujos de trabajo de versión con soporte multi-idioma y registro de cambios","fr":"Release-skills est un plugin qui permet l''automatisation des flux de travail de version avec prise en charge multi-langue et journal des modifications","de":"Release-skills ist ein Plugin, das die Automatisierung von Workflow-Versionen mit Multi-Language-Unterstützung und Änderungsprotokoll ermöglicht","pt":"O que é release-skills? Um plugin Claude Code que adiciona fórmulas de fluxo de trabalho personalizáveis ao Ralph loop","ru":"Что такое release-skills? Плагин Claude Code, который добавляет структурированные формулы рабочего процесса в цикл Ralph","ar":"ما هو release-skills؟ ملحق Claude Code يضيف صيغ سير العمل القابلة للتعديل إلى حلقة Ralph"},"features":{"en":["Auto-detects project configurations for Node.js, Python, Rust, and Claude Plugin projects","Supports multi-language changelog generation","Uses package.json, pyproject.toml, Cargo.toml, and other version files for auto-detection","Compatible with Generic projects using VERSION or version.txt files","Initiates release workflow with the `/release-skills` command"],"zh":["支持 Node.js、Python、Rust 和 Claude Plugin 项目","自动检测项目配置","结构化的可自定义的工作流公式","多语言的变更日志支持","使用 Beads 构建"],"ja":["Node.js、Python、Rust、Claude Plugin プロジェクトに対応","プロジェクト構成の自動検出","構造化されたカスタマイズ可能なワークフローフォーミュラ","多言語の変更ログのサポート","Beads を使用して構築"],"ko":["Node.js, Python, Rust 및 Claude Plugin 프로젝트 지원","프로젝트 구성 자동 감지","구조화된 워크플로 수식","다중 언어의 변경 로그 지원","Beads를 사용하여 구축"],"es":["Soporte para proyectos Node.js, Python, Rust y más","Fórmulas de flujo de trabajo estructuradas y personalizables","Registro de cambios multi-idioma","Detección automática de la configuración del proyecto","Compatibilidad con Claude Plugin y Generic"],"fr":["Prise en charge des projets Node.js, Python, Rust et plus","Formules de workflow structurées et personnalisables","Journal des modifications multi-langue","Détection automatique de la configuration du projet","Compatibilité avec Claude Plugin et Generic"],"de":["Unterstützung für Node.js-, Python-, Rust- und weitere Projekte","Strukturierte und anpassbare Workflow-Formeln","Multi-Language-Änderungsprotokoll","Automatische Erkennung der Projekt-Konfiguration","Kompatibilität mit Claude Plugin und Generic"],"pt":["Suporte a projetos em Node.js, Python, Rust e mais","Detecção automática da configuração do projeto","Fórmulas de fluxo de trabalho personalizáveis","Suporte a changelog multi-idioma","Integração com o Ralph loop"],"ru":["Поддержка проектов на Node.js, Python, Rust и других","Автоматическое обнаружение конфигурации проекта","Настраиваемые формулы рабочего процесса","Поддержка многоязычного changelog","Интеграция с циклом Ralph"],"ar":["دعم للمشاريع في Node.js و Python و Rust وغيرها","كشف تلقائي عن تكوين المشروع","صيغ سير العمل القابلة للتعديل","دعم سجل التغييرات المتعدد اللغات","التكامل مع حلقة Ralph"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use release-skills","release-skills alternative","release-skills setup guide","what is release-skills","release-skills vs Claude Code","release-skills install","universal release workflow","multi-language changelog generation","auto-detect project configuration"],"zh":["Release Skills","AI エージェント","项目发布流程","自动化","Node.js","Python","Rust","Claude Plugin","Beads"],"ja":["Release Skills","AIエージェント","プロジェクトのリリースプロセス","自動化","Node.js","Python","Rust","Claude Plugin","Beads"],"ko":["Release Skills","AI 도구","프로젝트 릴리스 프로세스","자동화","Node.js","Python","Rust","Claude Plugin","Beads"],"es":["release-skills","automatización de flujos de trabajo","versiones de software","registro de cambios","proyectos Node.js","proyectos Python","proyectos Rust","Claude Code","Ralph loop"],"fr":["release-skills","automatisation des flux de travail","versions de logiciel","journal des modifications","projets Node.js","projets Python","projets Rust","Claude Code","Ralph loop"],"de":["release-skills","Automatisierung von Workflows","Software-Versionen","Änderungsprotokoll","Node.js-Projekte","Python-Projekte","Rust-Projekte","Claude Code","Ralph-Loop"],"pt":["release-skills","fluxo de trabalho personalizável","Ralph loop","projetos Node.js","projetos Python","projetos Rust","changelog multi-idioma","plugin Claude Code"],"ru":["release-skills","настраиваемый рабочий процесс","цикл Ralph","проекты Node.js","проекты Python","проекты Rust","многоязычный changelog","плагин Claude Code"],"ar":["release-skills","سير عمل مخصص","حلقة Ralph","مشاريع Node.js","مشاريع Python","مشاريع Rust","سجل التغييرات المتعدد اللغات","ملحق Claude Code"]}},"owner":"mj-meyer","repo":"choo-choo-ralph","repoPath":"mj-meyer/choo-choo-ralph","stars":27,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T14:29:56Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release-skills","description":"Universal release workflow. Auto-detects version files and changelogs. Supports Node.js, Python, Rust, Claude Plugin, and generic projects. Use when user says release, 发布, new version, bump version, push, 推送.","bodyPreview":"# Release Skills\n\nUniversal release workflow supporting any project type with multi-language changelog.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nJust run `/release-skills` - auto-detects your project configuration.\n\n## Supported Projects\n\n| Project Type | Version File | Auto-Detected |\n|--------------|--------------|---------------|\n| Node.js | package.json | ✓ |\n| Python | pyproject.toml | ✓ |\n| Rust | Cargo.toml | ✓ |\n| Claude Plugin | marketplace.json + plugin.json | ✓ |\n| Generic | VERSION / version.txt | ✓ |\n\n## O","body":"# Release Skills\n\nUniversal release workflow supporting any project type with multi-language changelog.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nJust run `/release-skills` - auto-detects your project configuration.\n\n## Supported Projects\n\n| Project Type | Version File | Auto-Detected |\n|--------------|--------------|---------------|\n| Node.js | package.json | ✓ |\n| Python | pyproject.toml | ✓ |\n| Rust | Cargo.toml | ✓ |\n| Claude Plugin | marketplace.json + plugin.json | ✓ |\n| Generic | VERSION / version.txt | ✓ |\n\n## Options\n\n| Flag | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `--dry-run` | Preview changes without executing |\n| `--major` | Force major version bump |\n| `--minor` | Force minor version bump |\n| `--patch` | Force patch version bump |\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Detect Project Configuration\n\n1. Check for `.releaserc.yml` (optional config override)\n2. Auto-detect version file by scanning (priority order):\n   - `package.json` (Node.js)\n   - `pyproject.toml` (Python)\n   - `Cargo.toml` (Rust)\n   - `marketplace.json` or `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json` (Claude Plugin) - also update `plugin.json` or `.claude-plugin/plugin.json` if present\n   - `VERSION` or `version.txt` (Generic)\n3. Scan for changelog files using glob patterns:\n   - `CHANGELOG*.md`\n   - `HISTORY*.md`\n   - `CHANGES*.md`\n4. Identify language of each changelog by filename suffix\n5. Display detected configuration\n\n**Language Detection Rules**:\n\n| Filename Pattern | Language |\n|------------------|----------|\n| `CHANGELOG.md` (no suffix) | en (default) |\n| `CHANGELOG.zh.md` / `CHANGELOG_CN.md` / `CHANGELOG.zh-CN.md` | zh |\n| `CHANGELOG.ja.md` / `CHANGELOG_JP.md` | ja |\n| `CHANGELOG.ko.md` / `CHANGELOG_KR.md` | ko |\n| `CHANGELOG.de.md` / `CHANGELOG_DE.md` | de |\n| `CHANGELOG.fr.md` / `CHANGELOG_FR.md` | fr |\n| `CHANGELOG.es.md` / `CHANGELOG_ES.md` | es |\n| `CHANGELOG.{lang}.md` | Corresponding language code |\n\n**Output Example**:\n```\nProject detected:\n  Version file: package.json (1.2.3)\n  Changelogs:\n    - CHANGELOG.md (en)\n    - CHANGELOG.zh.md (zh)\n    - CHANGELOG.ja.md (ja)\n```\n\n### Step 2: Analyze Changes Since Last Tag\n\n```bash\nLAST_TAG=$(git tag --sort=-v:refname | head -1)\ngit log ${LAST_TAG}..HEAD --oneline\ngit diff ${LAST_TAG}..HEAD --stat\n```\n\nCategorize by conventional commit types:\n\n| Type | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| feat | New features |\n| fix | Bug fixes |\n| docs | Documentation |\n| refactor | Code refactoring |\n| perf | Performance improvements |\n| test | Test changes |\n| style | Formatting, styling |\n| chore | Maintenance (skip in changelog) |\n\n**Breaking Change Detection**:\n- Commit message starts with `BREAKING CHANGE`\n- Commit body/footer contains `BREAKING CHANGE:`\n- Removed public APIs, renamed exports, changed interfaces\n\nIf breaking changes detected, warn user: \"Breaking changes detected. Consider major version bump (--major flag).\"\n\n### Step 3: Determine Version Bump\n\nRules (in priority order):\n1. User flag `--major/--minor/--patch` → Use specified\n2. BREAKING CHANGE detected → Major bump (1.x.x → 2.0.0)\n3. `feat:` commits present → Minor bump (1.2.x → 1.3.0)\n4. Otherwise → Patch bump (1.2.3 → 1.2.4)\n\nDisplay version change: `1.2.3 → 1.3.0`\n\n### Step 4: Generate Multi-language Changelogs\n\nFor each detected changelog file:\n\n1. **Identify language** from filename suffix\n2. **Detect third-party contributors**:\n   - Check merge commits: `git log ${LAST_TAG}..HEAD --merges --pretty=format:\"%H %s\"`\n   - For each merged PR, identify the PR author via `gh pr view <number> --json author --jq ''.author.login''`\n   - Compare against repo owner (`gh repo view --json owner --jq ''.owner.login''`)\n   - If PR author ≠ repo owner → third-party contributor\n3. **Generate content in that language**:\n   - Section titles in target language\n   - Change descriptions written naturally in target language (not translated)\n   - Date format: YYYY-MM-DD (universal)\n   - **Third-party contributions**: Append contributor attribution `(by @username)` to the changelog entry\n4. **Insert at file head** (preserve existing content)\n\n**Section Title Translations** (built-in):\n\n| Type | en | zh | ja | ko | de | fr | es |\n|------|----|----|----|----|----|----|-----|\n| feat | Features | 新功能 | 新機能 | 새로운 기능 | Funktionen | Fonctionnalités | Características |\n| fix | Fixes | 修复 | 修正 | 수정 | Fehlerbehebungen | Corrections | Correcciones |\n| docs | Documentation | 文档 | ドキュメント | 문서 | Dokumentation | Documentation | Documentación |\n| refactor | Refactor | 重构 | リファクタリング | 리팩토링 | Refactoring | Refactorisation | Refactorización |\n| perf | Performance | 性能优化 | パフォーマンス | 성능 | Leistung | Performance | Rendimiento |\n| breaking | Breaking Changes | 破坏性变更 | 破壊的変更 | 주요 변경사항 | Breaking Changes | Changements majeurs | Cambios importantes |\n\n**Changelog Format**:\n\n```markdown\n## {VERSION} - {YYYY-MM-DD}\n\n### Features\n- Description of new feature\n- Description of third-party contribution (by @username)\n\n### Fixes\n- Description of fix\n\n### Documentation\n- Description of docs changes\n```\n\nOnly include sections that have changes. Omit empty sections.\n\n**Third-Party Attribution Rules**:\n- Only add `(by @username)` for contributors who are NOT the repo owner\n- Use GitHub username with `@` prefix\n- Place at the end of the changelog entry line\n- Apply to all languages consistently (always use `(by @username)` format, not translated)\n\n**Multi-language Example**:\n\nEnglish (CHANGELOG.md):\n```markdown\n## 1.3.0 - 2026-01-22\n\n### Features\n- Add user authentication module (by @contributor1)\n- Support OAuth2 login\n\n### Fixes\n- Fix memory leak in connection pool\n```\n\nChinese (CHANGELOG.zh.md):\n```markdown\n## 1.3.0 - 2026-01-22\n\n### 新功能\n- 新增用户认证模块 (by @contributor1)\n- 支持 OAuth2 登录\n\n### 修复\n- 修复连接池内存泄漏问题\n```\n\nJapanese (CHANGELOG.ja.md):\n```markdown\n## 1.3.0 - 2026-01-22\n\n### 新機能\n- ユーザー認証モジュールを追加 (by @contributor1)\n- OAuth2 ログインをサポート\n\n### 修正\n- コネクションプールのメモリリークを修正\n```\n\n### Step 5: Group Changes by Skill/Module\n\nAnalyze commits since last tag and group by affected skill/module:\n\n1. **Identify changed files** per commit\n2. **Group by skill/module**:\n   - `skills/<skill-name>/*` → Group under that skill\n   - Root files (CLAUDE.md, etc.) → Group as \"project\"\n   - Multiple skills in one commit → Split into multiple groups\n3. **For each group**, identify related README updates needed\n\n**Example Grouping**:\n```\nbaoyu-cover-image:\n  - feat: add new style options\n  - fix: handle transparent backgrounds\n  → README updates: options table\n\nbaoyu-comic:\n  - refactor: improve panel layout algorithm\n  → No README updates needed\n\nproject:\n  - docs: update CLAUDE.md architecture section\n```\n\n### Step 6: Commit Each Skill/Module Separately\n\nFor each skill/module group (in order of changes):\n\n1. **Check README updates needed**:\n   - Scan `README*.md` for mentions of this skill/module\n   - Verify options/flags documented correctly\n   - Update usage examples if syntax changed\n   - Update feature descriptions if behavior changed\n\n2. **Stage and commit**:\n   ```bash\n   git add skills/<skill-name>/*\n   git add README.md README.zh.md  # If updated for this skill\n   git commit -m \"<type>(<skill-name>): <meaningful description>\"\n   ```\n\n3. **Commit message format**:\n   - Use conventional commit format: `<type>(<scope>): <description>`\n   - `<type>`: feat, fix, refactor, docs, perf, etc.\n   - `<scope>`: skill name or \"project\"\n   - `<description>`: Clear, meaningful description of changes\n\n**Example Commits**:\n```bash\ngit commit -m \"feat(baoyu-cover-image): add watercolor and minimalist styles\"\ngit commit -m \"fix(baoyu-comic): improve panel layout for long dialogues\"\ngit commit -m \"docs(project): update architecture documentation\"\n```\n\n**Common README Updates Needed**:\n| Change Type | README Section to Check |\n|-------------|------------------------|\n| New options/flags | Options table, usage examples |\n| Renamed options | Options table, usage examples |\n| New features | Feature description, examples |\n| Breaking changes | Migration notes, deprecation warnings |\n| Restructured internals | Architecture section (if exposed to users) |\n\n### Step 7: Generate Changelog and Update Version\n\n1. **Generate multi-language changelogs** (as described in Step 4)\n2. **Update version file**:\n   - Read version file (JSON/TOML/text)\n   - Update version number\n   - Write back (preserve formatting)\n\n**Version Paths by File Type**:\n\n| File | Path |\n|------|------|\n| package.json | `$.version` |\n| pyproject.toml | `project.version` |\n| Cargo.toml | `package.version` |\n| marketplace.json | `$.metadata.version` and `$.plugins[0].version` |\n| plugin.json | `$.version` |\n| VERSION / version.txt | Direct content |\n\n### Step 8: User Confirmation\n\nBefore creating the release commit, ask user to confirm:\n\n**Use AskUserQuestion with two questions**:\n\n1. **Version bump** (single select):\n   - Show recommended version based on Step 3 analysis\n   - Options: recommended (with label), other semver options\n   - Example: `1.2.3 → 1.3.0 (Recommended)`, `1.2.3 → 1.2.4`, `1.2.3 → 2.0.0`\n\n2. **Push to remote** (single select):\n   - Options: \"Yes, push after commit\", \"No, keep local only\"\n\n**Example Output Before Confirmation**:\n```\nCommits created:\n  1. feat(baoyu-cover-image): add watercolor and minimalist styles\n  2. fix(baoyu-comic): improve panel layout for long dialogues\n  3. docs(project): update architecture documentation\n\nChangelog preview (en):\n  ## 1.3.0 - 2026-01-22\n  ### Features\n  - Add watercolor and minimalist styles to cover-image\n  ### Fixes\n  - Improve panel layout for long dialogues in comic\n\nReady to create release commit and tag.\n```\n\n### Step 9: Create Release Commit and Tag\n\nAfter user confirmation:\n\n1. **Stage version and changelog files**:\n   ```bash\n   git add <version-file>\n   git add CHANGELOG*.md\n   ```\n\n2. **Create release commit**:\n   ```bash\n   git commit -m \"chore: release v{VERSION}\"\n   ```\n\n3. **Create tag**:\n   ```bash\n   git tag v{VERSION}\n   ```\n\n4. **Push if user confirmed** (Step 8):\n   ```bash\n   git push origin main\n   git push origin v{VERSION}\n   ```\n\n**Note**: Do NOT add Co-Authored-By line. This is a release commit, not a code contribution.\n\n**Post-Release Output**:\n```\nRelease v1.3.0 created.\n\nCommits:\n  1. feat(baoyu-cover-image): add watercolor and minimalist styles\n  2. fix(baoyu-comic): improve panel layout for long dialogues\n  3. docs(project): update architecture documentation\n  4. chore: release v1.3.0\n\nTag: v1.3.0\nStatus: Pushed to origin  # or \"Local only - run git push when ready\"\n```\n\n## Configuration (.releaserc.yml)\n\nOptional config file in project root to override defaults:\n\n```yaml\n# .releaserc.yml - Optional configuration\n\n# Version file (auto-detected if not specified)\nversion:\n  file: package.json\n  path: $.version  # JSONPath for JSON, dotted path for TOML\n\n# Changelog files (auto-detected if not specified)\nchangelog:\n  files:\n    - path: CHANGELOG.md\n      lang: en\n    - path: CHANGELOG.zh.md\n      lang: zh\n    - path: CHANGELOG.ja.md\n      lang: ja\n\n  # Section mapping (conventional commit type → changelog section)\n  # Use null to skip a type in changelog\n  sections:\n    feat: Features\n    fix: Fixes\n    docs: Documentation\n    refactor: Refactor\n    perf: Performance\n    test: Tests\n    chore: null\n\n# Commit message format\ncommit:\n  message: \"chore: release v{version}\"\n\n# Tag format\ntag:\n  prefix: v  # Results in v1.0.0\n  sign: false\n\n# Additional files to include in release commit\ninclude:\n  - README.md\n  - package.json\n```\n\n## Dry-Run Mode\n\nWhen `--dry-run` is specified:\n\n```\n=== DRY RUN MODE ===\n\nProject detected:\n  Version file: package.json (1.2.3)\n  Changelogs: CHANGELOG.md (en), CHANGELOG.zh.md (zh)\n\nLast tag: v1.2.3\nProposed version: v1.3.0\n\nChanges grouped by skill/module:\n  baoyu-cover-image:\n    - feat: add watercolor style\n    - feat: add minimalist style\n    → Commit: feat(baoyu-cover-image): add watercolor and minimalist styles\n    → README updates: options table\n\n  baoyu-comic:\n    - fix: panel layout for long dialogues\n    → Commit: fix(baoyu-comic): improve panel layout for long dialogues\n    → No README updates\n\nChangelog preview (en):\n  ## 1.3.0 - 2026-01-22\n  ### Features\n  - Add watercolor and minimalist styles to cover-image\n  ### Fixes\n  - Improve panel layout for long dialogues in comic\n\nChangelog preview (zh):\n  ## 1.3.0 - 2026-01-22\n  ### 新功能\n  - 为 cover-image 添加水彩和极简风格\n  ### 修复\n  - 改进 comic 长对话的面板布局\n\nCommits to create:\n  1. feat(baoyu-cover-image): add watercolor and minimalist styles\n  2. fix(baoyu-comic): improve panel layout for long dialogues\n  3. chore: release v1.3.0\n\nNo changes made. Run without --dry-run to execute.\n```\n\n## Example Usage\n\n```\n/release-skills              # Auto-detect version bump\n/release-skills --dry-run    # Preview only\n/release-skills --minor      # Force minor bump\n/release-skills --patch      # Force patch bump\n/release-skills --major      # Force major bump (with confirmation)\n```\n\n## When to Use\n\nTrigger this skill when user requests:\n- \"release\", \"发布\", \"create release\", \"new version\", \"新版本\"\n- \"bump version\", \"update version\", \"更新版本\"\n- \"prepare release\"\n- \"push to remote\" (with uncommitted changes)\n\n**Important**: If user says \"just push\" or \"直接 push\" with uncommitted changes, STILL follow all steps above first.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:39:32.094Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated release workflow management with multi-language changelog generation.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化发布工作流程管理并支持多语言变更日志生成的开发智能体。","ja":"多言語変更履歴生成を備えた自動リリースワークフロー管理を必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"다국어 변경 로그 생성이 가능한 자동화된 릴리스 워크플로우 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una gestión de flujo de trabajo de lanzamiento automatizado con generación de registros de cambios multilenguaje.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion de flux de travail de publication automatisée avec génération de journal des modifications multilingue.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Release-Workflow-Verwaltung mit mehrsprachiger Changelog-Generierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho de lançamento automatizado com geração de registro de alterações multilíngue.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходим автоматизированный менеджмент рабочего процесса выпуска с генерацией многоязычного журнала изменений.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة تدفق العمل التلقائي لإصدار العمل مع توليد سجل التغييرات المتعددة اللغات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate release workflows with structured formulas, supporting multi-language changelog generation for various project types, including Node.js, Python, Rust, and Claude Plugin, using files like package.json, pyproject.toml, and Cargo.toml.","zh":"使智能体能够通过结构化公式自动化发布工作流程，支持为包括Node.js、Python、Rust和Claude Plugin在内的各种项目类型生成多语言变更日志，使用诸如package.json、pyproject.toml和Cargo.toml等文件。","ja":"構造化された式を使用してリリースワークフローを自動化し、package.json、pyproject.toml、Cargo.tomlなどのファイルを使用して、Node.js、Python、Rust、Claude Pluginを含む様々なプロジェクトタイプの多言語変更履歴生成をサポートすることで、エージェントを強化します。","ko":"Node.js, Python, Rust 및 Claude Plugin을 포함한 다양한 프로젝트 유형에 대해 package.json, pyproject.toml, Cargo.toml과 같은 파일을 사용하여 다국어 변경 로그 생성을 지원하는 구조화된 공식으로 릴리스 워크플로우를 자동화하여 에이전트의 능력을 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar flujos de trabajo de lanzamiento con fórmulas estructuradas, admitiendo la generación de registros de cambios multilenguaje para varios tipos de proyectos, incluidos Node.js, Python, Rust y Claude Plugin, utilizando archivos como package.json, pyproject.toml y Cargo.toml.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les flux de travail de publication avec des formules structurées, en prenant en charge la génération de journaux des modifications multilingues pour différents types de projets, notamment Node.js, Python, Rust et Claude Plugin, en utilisant des fichiers tels que package.json, pyproject.toml et Cargo.toml.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Release-Workflows mit strukturierten Formeln zu automatisieren, die die Generierung von mehrsprachigen Changelogs für verschiedene Projekttypen unterstützen, einschließlich Node.js, Python, Rust und Claude Plugin, unter Verwendung von Dateien wie package.json, pyproject.toml und Cargo.toml.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar fluxos de trabalho de lançamento com fórmulas estruturadas, oferecendo suporte à geração de registros de alterações multilíngues para vários tipos de projetos, incluindo Node.js, Python, Rust e Claude Plugin, usando arquivos como package.json, pyproject.toml e Cargo.toml.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рабочие процессы выпуска с помощью структурированных формул, поддерживая генерацию многоязычного журнала изменений для различных типов проектов, включая Node.js, Python, Rust и Claude Plugin, используя файлы như package.json, pyproject.toml и Cargo.toml.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توفير سير عمل إصدار آلي مع صيغ منظمة ، ودعم توليد سجل التغييرات المتعددة اللغات لمختلف أنواع المشاريع ، بما في ذلك Node.js و Python و Rust و Claude Plugin ، باستخدام الملفات مثل package.json و pyproject.toml و Cargo.toml."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating release workflows for Node.js projects","Generating multi-language changelogs for Python applications","Streamlining Rust project releases with Cargo.toml"],"zh":["自动化Node.js项目的发布工作流程","为Python应用程序生成多语言变更日志","使用Cargo.toml简化Rust项目发布"],"ja":["Node.jsプロジェクトのリリースワークフローの自動化","Pythonアプリケーションのための多言語変更履歴の生成","Cargo.tomlを使用したRustプロジェクトリリースの効率化"],"ko":["Node.js 프로젝트의 릴리스 워크플로우 자동화","Python 애플리케이션용 다국어 변경 로그 생성","Cargo.toml을 사용한 Rust 프로젝트 릴리스 간소화"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de lanzamiento para proyectos Node.js","Generar registros de cambios multilenguaje para aplicaciones Python","Optimizar los lanzamientos de proyectos Rust con Cargo.toml"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail de publication pour les projets Node.js","Générer des journaux des modifications multilingues pour les applications Python","Optimiser les publications de projets Rust avec Cargo.toml"],"de":["Automatisierung von Release-Workflows für Node.js-Projekte","Generierung von mehrsprachigen Changelogs für Python-Anwendungen","Optimierung von Rust-Projekt-Veröffentlichungen mit Cargo.toml"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de lançamento para projetos Node.js","Gerar registros de alterações multilíngues para aplicações Python","Otimizar lançamentos de projetos Rust com Cargo.toml"],"ru":["Автоматизация рабочих процессов выпуска для проектов Node.js","Генерация многоязычного журнала изменений для приложений Python","Оптимизация выпуска проектов Rust с помощью Cargo.toml"],"ar":["توفير سير عمل إصدار آلي لمشاريع Node.js","توليد سجل التغييرات المتعددة اللغات للتطبيقات Python","تحسين إصدار مشاريع Rust مع Cargo.toml"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires project configuration files like package.json or pyproject.toml","Limited to supported project types"],"zh":["需要项目配置文件，如package.json或pyproject.toml","仅限于支持的项目类型"],"ja":["package.jsonやpyproject.tomlなどのプロジェクト設定ファイルが必要","サポート対象のプロジェクトタイプに限定される"],"ko":["package.json 또는 pyproject.toml과 같은 프로젝트 구성 파일 필요","지원되는 프로젝트 유형으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere archivos de configuración de proyecto como package.json o pyproject.toml","Limitado a tipos de proyectos compatibles"],"fr":["Nécessite des fichiers de configuration de projet tels que package.json ou pyproject.toml","Limité aux types de projets pris en charge"],"de":["Benötigt Projekt-Konfigurationsdateien wie package.json oder pyproject.toml","Begrenzt auf unterstützte Projekttypen"],"pt":["Exige arquivos de configuração de projeto como package.json ou pyproject.toml","Limitado a tipos de projetos suportados"],"ru":["Требует файлов конфигурации проекта, таких как package.json или pyproject.toml","Ограничен поддерживаемыми типами проектов"],"ar":["يتطلب ملفات تكوين المشروع مثل package.json أو pyproject.toml","محدود بنوعيات المشاريع المدعومة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"220b163cfe79562e417d5fe8a2586d254aabac186a86bb667a087743196d94be","qualityScore":59}');
