INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('mj-meyer/choo-choo-ralph/release-skills', 'release-skills', 'mj-meyer', 'choo-choo-ralph', 'community', 'release-skills mj-meyer choo-choo-ralph community The release-skills plugin adds structured workflow formulas to the Ralph loop, supporting various project types. It benefits developers by automating release workflows with multi-language changelog generation. Release Skills 是一个 Claude Code 插件，提供结构化的可自定义的工作流公式，支持多语言的变更日志 Release Skills は Claude Code プラグインであり、構造化されたカスタマイズ可能なワークフローフォーミュラを提供し、多言語の変更ログをサポートします Release Skills는 Claude Code 플러그인으로 구조화된 워크플로 수식을 제공하며 다중 언어의 변경 로그를 지원합니다 Release-skills es un plugin de Claude Code que agrega fórmulas de flujo de trabajo estructuradas y personalizables al bucle de Ralph. Soporta proyectos Node.js, Python, Rust y más Release-skills est un plugin Claude Code qui ajoute des formules de workflow structurées et personnalisables à la boucle Ralph. Il prend en charge les projets Node.js, Python, Rust et plus Release-skills ist ein Claude-Code-Plugin, das strukturierte und anpassbare Workflow-Formeln zum Ralph-Loop hinzufügt. Es unterstützt Node.js-, Python-, Rust- und weitere Projekte O release-skills é um plugin Claude Code que adiciona fluxos de trabalho personalizáveis ao Ralph loop, suportando projetos em Node.js, Python, Rust e mais Release-skills - это плагин Claude Code, который добавляет настраиваемые рабочие процессы в цикл Ralph, поддерживая проекты на Node.js, Python, Rust и других release-skills هو ملحق Claude Code يضيف سير عمل مخصصة إلى حلقة Ralph، يدعم مشاريع Node.js و Python و Rust وغيرها how to use release-skills release-skills alternative release-skills setup guide what is release-skills release-skills vs Claude Code release-skills install universal release workflow multi-language changelog generation auto-detect project configuration Release Skills AI エージェント 项目发布流程 自动化 Node.js Python Rust Claude Plugin Beads Auto-detects project configurations for Node.js, Python, Rust, and Claude Plugin projects Supports multi-language changelog generation Uses package.json, pyproject.toml, Cargo.toml, and other version files for auto-detection Compatible with Generic projects using VERSION or version.txt files Initiates release workflow with the `/release-skills` command release-skills is a Claude Code plugin that provides a universal release workflow, supporting Node.js, Python, Rust, and other project types with auto-detection and customizable formulas.');
