es états et des backends distants","Déploiements multi-cloud et multi-environnement","Intégration avec CI/CD","Gestion sécurisée des secrets","Modèles d''infrastructure complexes"],"de":["Design wiederverwendbarer Module für Terraform","Verwaltung von Zuständen und Remote-Backends","Multi-Cloud- und Multi-Umgebungs-Deployments","Integration mit CI/CD","Sichere Geheimnisverwaltung","Komplexe Infrastruktur-Muster"],"pt":["Design de módulos reutilizáveis","Gerenciamento de estado e backends remotos","Implantação multi-nuvem e integração com CI/CD","Gerenciamento de segredos e configuração de ambientes","Suporte a padrões de infraestrutura complexos"],"ru":["Проектирование повторно используемых модулей","Управление состоянием и удаленными бэкендами","Многооблачная развертка и интеграция с CI/CD","Управление секретами и настройка сред","Поддержка сложных шаблонов инфраструктуры"],"ar":["تصميم الوحدات القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","إدارة الحالة والخلفيات البعيدة","نشر متعددة السحابة وتكامل مع CI/CD","إدارة الأسرار وتكوين البيئات","دعم أنماط البنية التحتية المعقدة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use terraform-iac-expert","terraform-iac-expert setup guide","terraform-iac-expert vs terragrunt","terraform-iac-expert install","what is terraform-iac-expert","terraform-iac-expert alternative","terraform-iac-expert tutorial","terraform-iac-expert best practices","terraform-iac-expert multi-cloud deployments"],"zh":["Terraform IaC","基础设施即代码","模块设计","状态管理","多云部署","CI/CD 集成","AIエージェント","Terraform 专家"],"ja":["Terraform IaC","インフラストラクチャ即コード","モジュール設計","状態管理","マルチクラウド展開","CI/CD 統合","AIエージェント","Terraform エキスパート"],"ko":["Terraform IaC","인프라스트ラク처 即 코드","모듈 디자인","상태 관리","멀티 클라우드 배포","CI/CD 통합","AI 에이전트","Terraform 전문가"],"es":["Terraform IaC Expert","Infraestructura como código","Despliegues multi-nube","Gestión de estados y secretos","Diseño de módulos reutilizables","Integración con CI/CD","Patrones de infraestructura complejos","Terraform y OpenTofu"],"fr":["Terraform IaC Expert","Infrastructure en tant que code","Déploiements multi-cloud","Gestion des états et des secrets","Conception de modules réutilisables","Intégration avec CI/CD","Modèles d''infrastructure complexes","Terraform et OpenTofu"],"de":["Terraform IaC Expert","Infrastruktur als Code","Multi-Cloud-Deployments","Verwaltung von Zuständen und Geheimnissen","Design wiederverwendbarer Module","Integration mit CI/CD","Komplexe Infrastruktur-Muster","Terraform und OpenTofu"],"pt":["Terraform IaC Expert","Infrastructure as Code","Terraform","OpenTofu","gerenciamento de infraestrutura","implantação multi-nuvem","CI/CD","segurança de infraestrutura","padrões de infraestrutura complexos"],"ru":["Terraform IaC Expert","Инфраструктура как код","Terraform","OpenTofu","управление инфраструктурой","многооблачная развертка","CI/CD","безопасность инфраструктуры","сложные шаблоны инфраструктуры"],"ar":["Terraform IaC Expert","بنية تحتية كود","Terraform","OpenTofu","إدارة البنية التحتية","نشر متعددة السحابة","CI/CD","أمان البنية التحتية","أنماط البنية التحتية المعقدة"]}},"owner":"curiositech","repo":"some_claude_skills","repoPath":"curiositech/some_claude_skills","stars":47,"forks":7,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T02:12:13Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"terraform-iac-expert","description":"Terraform and OpenTofu infrastructure as code — module design, state management, multi-environment setups, remote backends, secrets management, CI/CD integration. NOT for Pulumi, CDK, Ansible,","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Terraform IaC Expert\n\n## Overview\n\nExpert in Infrastructure as Code using Terraform and OpenTofu. Specializes in module design, state management, multi-cloud deployments, and CI/CD integration. Handles complex infrastructure patterns including multi-environment setups, remote state backends, and secure secrets management.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Setting up new Terraform projects and workspaces\n- Designing reusable Terraform modules\n- Managing state files and remote backends\n- Implementing multi-env","body":"# Terraform IaC Expert\n\n## Overview\n\nExpert in Infrastructure as Code using Terraform and OpenTofu. Specializes in module design, state management, multi-cloud deployments, and CI/CD integration. Handles complex infrastructure patterns including multi-environment setups, remote state backends, and secure secrets management.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Setting up new Terraform projects and workspaces\n- Designing reusable Terraform modules\n- Managing state files and remote backends\n- Implementing multi-environment (dev/staging/prod) infrastructure\n- Migrating existing infrastructure to Terraform\n- Troubleshooting state drift and plan failures\n- Integrating Terraform with CI/CD pipelines\n- Implementing security best practices (secrets, IAM, policies)\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Project Structure\n- Module-based architecture design\n- Workspace vs directory structure strategies\n- Variable and output organization\n- Provider configuration and version constraints\n- Backend configuration for remote state\n\n### Module Development\n- Reusable module patterns\n- Input validation and type constraints\n- Output design for module composition\n- Local modules vs registry modules\n- Module versioning and publishing\n\n### State Management\n- Remote state backends (S3, GCS, Azure Blob, Terraform Cloud)\n- State locking mechanisms\n- State migration and manipulation\n- Import existing resources\n- Handling state drift\n\n### Multi-Environment Patterns\n- Workspace-based environments\n- Directory-based environments\n- Terragrunt for DRY infrastructure\n- Environment-specific variables\n- Promotion workflows\n\n### Security\n- Sensitive variable handling\n- IAM role design for Terraform\n- Policy as Code (Sentinel, OPA)\n- Secrets management integration (Vault, AWS Secrets Manager)\n- Least privilege principles\n\n### CI/CD Integration\n- GitHub Actions for Terraform\n- Atlantis for PR-based workflows\n- Terraform Cloud/Enterprise\n- Plan/Apply automation\n- Cost estimation integration\n\n## Dependencies\n\nWorks well with:\n- `aws-solutions-architect` - AWS resource patterns\n- `kubernetes-orchestrator` - K8s infrastructure\n- `github-actions-pipeline-builder` - CI/CD automation\n- `site-reliability-engineer` - Production infrastructure\n\n## Examples\n\n### Project Structure\n```\nterraform/\n├── modules/\n│   ├── vpc/\n│   │   ├── main.tf\n│   │   ├── variables.tf\n│   │   └── outputs.tf\n│   ├── eks/\n│   └── rds/\n├── environments/\n│   ├── dev/\n│   │   ├── main.tf\n│   │   ├── variables.tf\n│   │   ├── terraform.tfvars\n│   │   └── backend.tf\n│   ├── staging/\n│   └── prod/\n└── shared/\n    └── provider.tf\n```\n\n### Root Module with Locals\n```hcl\n# environments/prod/main.tf\nterraform {\n  required_version = \">= 1.5.0\"\n\n  required_providers {\n    aws = {\n      source  = \"hashicorp/aws\"\n      version = \"~> 5.0\"\n    }\n  }\n\n  backend \"s3\" {\n    bucket         = \"mycompany-terraform-state\"\n    key            = \"prod/terraform.tfstate\"\n    region         = \"us-west-2\"\n    encrypt        = true\n    dynamodb_table = \"terraform-locks\"\n  }\n}\n\nlocals {\n  environment = \"prod\"\n  project     = \"myapp\"\n\n  common_tags = {\n    Environment = local.environment\n    Project     = local.project\n    ManagedBy   = \"terraform\"\n  }\n}\n\nmodule \"vpc\" {\n  source = \"../../modules/vpc\"\n\n  environment = local.environment\n  cidr_block  = \"10.0.0.0/16\"\n  tags        = local.common_tags\n}\n\nmodule \"eks\" {\n  source = \"../../modules/eks\"\n\n  environment       = local.environment\n  vpc_id            = module.vpc.vpc_id\n  private_subnet_ids = module.vpc.private_subnet_ids\n  cluster_version   = \"1.29\"\n  tags              = local.common_tags\n}\n```\n\n### Reusable Module with Validation\n```hcl\n# modules/vpc/variables.tf\nvariable \"environment\" {\n  type        = string\n  description = \"Environment name (dev, staging, prod)\"\n\n  validation {\n    condition     = contains([\"dev\", \"staging\", \"prod\"], var.environment)\n    error_message = \"Environment must be dev, staging, or prod.\"\n  }\n}\n\nvariable \"cidr_block\" {\n  type        = string\n  description = \"VPC CIDR block\"\n\n  validation {\n    condition     = can(cidrhost(var.cidr_block, 0))\n    error_message = \"Must be a valid CIDR block.\"\n  }\n}\n\nvariable \"availability_zones\" {\n  type        = list(string)\n  description = \"List of AZs to use\"\n  default     = [\"us-west-2a\", \"us-west-2b\", \"us-west-2c\"]\n}\n\nvariable \"enable_nat_gateway\" {\n  type        = bool\n  description = \"Enable NAT Gateway for private subnets\"\n  default     = true\n}\n\nvariable \"tags\" {\n  type        = map(string)\n  description = \"Tags to apply to all resources\"\n  default     = {}\n}\n```\n\n### Module with Dynamic Blocks\n```hcl\n# modules/security-group/main.tf\nresource \"aws_security_group\" \"this\" {\n  name        = var.name\n  description = var.description\n  vpc_id      = var.vpc_id\n\n  dynamic \"ingress\" {\n    for_each = var.ingress_rules\n    content {\n      from_port   = ingress.value.from_port\n      to_port     = ingress.value.to_port\n      protocol    = ingress.value.protocol\n      cidr_blocks = ingress.value.cidr_blocks\n      description = ingress.value.description\n    }\n  }\n\n  egress {\n    from_port   = 0\n    to_port     = 0\n    protocol    = \"-1\"\n    cidr_blocks = [\"0.0.0.0/0\"]\n  }\n\n  tags = merge(var.tags, {\n    Name = var.name\n  })\n}\n```\n\n### Remote State Data Source\n```hcl\n# Reference another environment''s state\ndata \"terraform_remote_state\" \"shared\" {\n  backend = \"s3\"\n\n  config = {\n    bucket = \"mycompany-terraform-state\"\n    key    = \"shared/terraform.tfstate\"\n    region = \"us-west-2\"\n  }\n}\n\n# Use outputs from shared state\nresource \"aws_instance\" \"app\" {\n  ami           = data.terraform_remote_state.shared.outputs.base_ami_id\n  instance_type = \"t3.medium\"\n  subnet_id     = data.terraform_remote_state.shared.outputs.private_subnet_id\n}\n```\n\n### GitHub Actions CI/CD\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/terraform.yml\nname: Terraform\n\non:\n  pull_request:\n    paths:\n      - ''terraform/**''\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n    paths:\n      - ''terraform/**''\n\nenv:\n  TF_VERSION: 1.6.0\n  AWS_REGION: us-west-2\n\njobs:\n  plan:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    permissions:\n      contents: read\n      pull-requests: write\n      id-token: write  # For OIDC\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Configure AWS credentials\n        uses: aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials@v4\n        with:\n          role-to-assume: arn:aws:iam::123456789:role/terraform-github-actions\n          aws-region: ${{ env.AWS_REGION }}\n\n      - uses: hashicorp/setup-terraform@v3\n        with:\n          terraform_version: ${{ env.TF_VERSION }}\n\n      - name: Terraform Init\n        working-directory: terraform/environments/prod\n        run: terraform init\n\n      - name: Terraform Plan\n        working-directory: terraform/environments/prod\n        run: terraform plan -out=tfplan\n\n      - name: Upload Plan\n        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          name: tfplan\n          path: terraform/environments/prod/tfplan\n\n  apply:\n    needs: plan\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    if: github.ref == ''refs/heads/main'' && github.event_name == ''push''\n    environment: production\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Configure AWS credentials\n        uses: aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials@v4\n        with:\n          role-to-assume: arn:aws:iam::123456789:role/terraform-github-actions\n          aws-region: ${{ env.AWS_REGION }}\n\n      - uses: hashicorp/setup-terraform@v3\n        with:\n          terraform_version: ${{ env.TF_VERSION }}\n\n      - name: Download Plan\n        uses: actions/download-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          name: tfplan\n          path: terraform/environments/prod\n\n      - name: Terraform Apply\n        working-directory: terraform/environments/prod\n        run: terraform apply -auto-approve tfplan\n```\n\n### Import Existing Resources\n```bash\n# Import existing AWS resource into state\nterraform import aws_s3_bucket.existing my-existing-bucket\n\n# Import using for_each key\nterraform import ''aws_iam_user.users[\"alice\"]'' alice\n\n# Generate configuration from import (Terraform 1.5+)\nterraform plan -generate-config-out=generated.tf\n```\n\n### Handling Sensitive Values\n```hcl\n# Reference secrets from AWS Secrets Manager\ndata \"aws_secretsmanager_secret_version\" \"db_password\" {\n  secret_id = \"prod/db/password\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_db_instance\" \"main\" {\n  # ... other config ...\n  password = data.aws_secretsmanager_secret_version.db_password.secret_string\n}\n\n# Mark outputs as sensitive\noutput \"db_connection_string\" {\n  value     = \"postgres://admin:${aws_db_instance.main.password}@${aws_db_instance.main.endpoint}\"\n  sensitive = true\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use remote state** - Never store state locally for team projects\n2. **Enable state locking** - Prevent concurrent modifications\n3. **Version pin providers** - Use `~>` constraints, not `>=`\n4. **Separate environments** - Use directories or workspaces, not branches\n5. **Module everything reusable** - But don''t over-abstract\n6. **Validate inputs** - Use variable validation blocks\n7. **Use data sources** - Reference existing resources instead of hardcoding\n8. **Tag all resources** - Apply consistent tags for cost tracking\n9. **Review plans carefully** - Especially for destroy operations\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **State file conflicts** - Multiple people running terraform simultaneously\n- **Hardcoded values** - Not using variables for environment differences\n- **Circular dependencies** - Resources depending on each other\n- **Missing dependencies** - Not using `depends_on` when implicit deps aren''t enough\n- **Large state files** - Not breaking up large infrastructure\n- **Secrets in state** - State contains sensitive values, encrypt at rest\n- **Provider version drift** - Different team members using different versions\n- **Not using -target carefully** - Can cause drift, use sparingly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T01:58:28.206Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Infrastructure Agents requiring streamlined Terraform and OpenTofu management for multi-cloud deployments and CI/CD integration.","zh":"适用于需要简化Terraform和OpenTofu管理的多云部署和CI/CD集成的云基础设施代理的理想选择。","ja":"TerraformとOpenTofuの管理を簡素化したマルチクラウドデプロイとCI/CD統合を必要とするクラウドインフラストラクチャエージェントに最適です。","ko":"스트림라인 Terraform 및 OpenTofu 관리를 위한 멀티 클라우드 배포 및 CI/CD 통합을 요구하는 클라우드 인프라 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de infraestructura en la nube que requieren una gestión simplificada de Terraform y OpenTofu para implementaciones de multi-nube y integración de CI/CD.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''infrastructure cloud nécessitant une gestion simplifiée de Terraform et OpenTofu pour les déploiements multi-cloud et l''intégration CI/CD.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Infrastruktur-Agents, die eine vereinfachte Verwaltung von Terraform und OpenTofu für Multi-Cloud-Deployments und CI/CD-Integration erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de infraestrutura em nuvem que exigem gestão simplificada do Terraform e OpenTofu para implantações multi-nuvem e integração de CI/CD.","ru":"Идеально для агентов облачной инфраструктуры, требующих упрощенного управления Terraform и OpenTofu для мультиоблачных развертываний и интеграции CI/CD.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البنيويين السحابيين الذين يتطلبون إدارة مبسطّة لبرامج Terraform و OpenTofu من أجل النشرات متعددة السحابيات وتكامل CI/CD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design reusable Terraform modules, manage state files and remote backends, and implement secure secrets management using Terraform and OpenTofu, facilitating efficient infrastructure as code (IaC) management and multi-environment setups.","zh":"赋予代理设计可重用Terraform模块、管理状态文件和远程后端、使用Terraform和OpenTofu实现安全的密钥管理，促进高效的基础设施即代码（IaC）管理和多环境设置。","ja":"エージェントに、再利用可能なTerraformモジュールを設計し、状態ファイルやリモートバックエンドを管理し、TerraformとOpenTofuを使用してセキュアなシークレット管理を実装することを可能にし、効率的なインフラストラクチャー即コード（IaC）管理とマルチ環境設定を促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 재사용 가능한 Terraform 모듈을 설계하고 상태 파일 및 원격 백엔드를 관리하며 Terraform 및 OpenTofu를 사용하여 보안 시크릿 관리를 구현하여 효율적인 인프라스트럭처 즉 코드(IaC) 관리 및 멀티 환경 설정을促進합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar módulos de Terraform reutilizables, gestionar archivos de estado y backends remotos, e implementar una gestión segura de secretos utilizando Terraform y OpenTofu, lo que facilita una gestión eficiente de la infraestructura como código (IaC) y configuraciones multi-entorno.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des modules Terraform réutilisables, de gérer des fichiers d''état et des backends distants, et de mettre en œuvre une gestion sécurisée des secrets en utilisant Terraform et OpenTofu, facilitant ainsi une gestion efficace de l''infrastructure en tant que code (IaC) et des configurations multi-environnement.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, wiederverwendbare Terraform-Module zu entwerfen, Statusdateien und Remote-Backends zu verwalten und eine sichere Geheimnisverwaltung mithilfe von Terraform und OpenTofu zu implementieren, was eine effiziente Infrastruktur-als-Code- (IaC-) Verwaltung und Multi-Umgebungs-Einrichtungen erleichtert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetarem módulos reutilizáveis do Terraform, gerenciar arquivos de estado e back-ends remotos, e implementar gerenciamento seguro de segredos usando Terraform e OpenTofu, facilitando a gestão eficiente da infraestrutura como código (IaC) e configurações multi-ambientes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать переиспользуемые модули Terraform, управлять файлами состояния и удаленными бэкендами, а также реализовывать безопасное управление секретами с помощью Terraform и OpenTofu, облегчая эффективное управление инфраструктурой как кодом (IaC) и многосредовые настройки.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم وحدات Terraform قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام، وإدارة ملفات الحالة والخلفيات البعيدة، وتنفيذ إدارة أمان للأسرار باستخدام Terraform و OpenTofu، مما يسهل إدارة البنية التحتية بكفاءة على أنها رمز (IaC) وإعدادات بيئات متعددة."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing and deploying reusable Terraform modules for consistent infrastructure","Managing and securing remote state backends for multi-cloud environments","Implementing CI/CD pipelines with Terraform for automated infrastructure provisioning"],"zh":["为一致的基础设施设计和部署可重用Terraform模块","为多云环境管理和保护远程状态后端","使用Terraform实现CI/CD流水线以自动化基础设施提供"],"ja":["一貫したインフラストラクチャーのために再利用可能なTerraformモジュールを設計してデプロイする","マルチクラウド環境のリモート状態バックエンドを管理してセキュアにする","Terraformを使用してCI/CDパイプラインを実装してインフラストラクチャーのプロビジョニングを自動化する"],"ko":["일관된 인프라스트럭처를 위한 재사용 가능한 Terraform 모듈을 설계하고 배포하는 것","멀티 클라우드 환경을 위한 원격 상태 백엔드 관리 및 보호","Terraform를 사용하여 CI/CD 파이프라인을 구현하여 인프라스트럭처 제공을 자동화하는 것"],"es":["Diseñar e implementar módulos de Terraform reutilizables para una infraestructura coherente","Gestionar y proteger backends de estado remotos para entornos de multi-nube","Implementar tuberías de CI/CD con Terraform para la provision de infraestructura automatizada"],"fr":["Concevoir et déployer des modules Terraform réutilisables pour une infrastructure cohérente","Gérer et sécuriser les backends d''état distants pour les environnements multi-cloud","Mettre en œuvre des pipelines CI/CD avec Terraform pour la provision d''infrastructure automatisée"],"de":["Entwerfen und bereitstellen von wiederverwendbaren Terraform-Modulen für eine konsistente Infrastruktur","Verwalten und sichern von Remote-Status-Backends für Multi-Cloud-Umgebungen","Implementieren von CI/CD-Pipelines mit Terraform für automatisierte Infrastruktur-Bereitstellung"],"pt":["Projetar e implantar módulos reutilizáveis do Terraform para infraestrutura consistente","Gerenciar e proteger back-ends de estado remoto para ambientes multi-nuvem","Implementar pipelines de CI/CD com Terraform para provisionamento automático de infraestrutura"],"ru":["Проектировать и развертывать переиспользуемые модули Terraform для согласованной инфраструктуры","Управлять и защищать удаленные бэкенды состояния для мультиоблачных сред","Реализовывать конвейеры CI/CD с Terraform для автоматического обеспечения инфраструктуры"],"ar":["تصميم وحدات Terraform قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لنشر بنية تحتية متسقّة","إدارة وتأمين خلفيات الحالة البعيدة لبيئات متعددة السحابيات","تنفيذ خطوط أنابيب CI/CD مع Terraform لتوفير بنية تحتية تلقائي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Terraform and OpenTofu setup and configuration","Limited to infrastructure management using Terraform and OpenTofu"],"zh":["需要Terraform和OpenTofu的设置和配置","仅限于使用Terraform和OpenTofu进行基础设施管理"],"ja":["TerraformとOpenTofuの設定と構成が必要","TerraformとOpenTofuを使用したインフラストラクチャー管理に限定される"],"ko":["Terraform 및 OpenTofu 설정 및 구성이 필요","Terraform 및 OpenTofu를 사용한 인프라스트럭처 관리에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración y configuración de Terraform y OpenTofu","Limitado a la gestión de infraestructura utilizando Terraform y OpenTofu"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration et la configuration de Terraform et OpenTofu","Limité à la gestion de l''infrastructure en utilisant Terraform et OpenTofu"],"de":["Benötigt Einrichtung und Konfiguration von Terraform und OpenTofu","Begrenzt auf die Infrastrukturverwaltung unter Verwendung von Terraform und OpenTofu"],"pt":["Exige configuração e instalação do Terraform e OpenTofu","Limitado à gestão de infraestrutura usando Terraform e OpenTofu"],"ru":["Требует настройки и установки Terraform и OpenTofu","Ограничен управлением инфраструктурой с помощью Terraform и OpenTofu"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد وتثبيت Terraform و OpenTofu","محدود بالتحكم في البنية التحتية باستخدام Terraform و OpenTofu"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"06a1daa9110877515e778de1faa4e0e5ee36c1de2f60296f533f07ab009fea17","qualityScore":59}');
