verwendet","pt":"O ESM2 é um modelo de linguagem de proteínas para design de proteínas","ru":"ESM2 - это модель языка белков для проектирования белков","ar":"إسم2 هو نموذج لغة البروتينات لتصميم البروتينات"},"features":{"en":["Utilizes the ESM2 Protein Language Model for protein design","Requires Python 3.8+, PyTorch 1.10+, and CUDA 11.0+ for operation","Supports GPU VRAM of 8GB or more, with 24GB recommended","Can be run using the Modal platform with biomodals","Executes the modal_esm2_predict_masked.py script for predictions","Accepts input in FASTA format via the --input-faa parameter"],"zh":["使用Python 3.8+和PyTorch 1.10+","需要CUDA 11.0+和GPU VRAM 8GB以上","支持蛋白质语言模型的预测和设计","使用Modal和biomodals进行设置和运行","需要RAM 16GB以上"],"ja":["Python 3.8+とPyTorch 1.10+を使用","CUDA 11.0+とGPU VRAM 8GB以上が必要","タンパク質言語モデルの予測と設計をサポート","Modalとbiomodalsを使用して設定と実行","RAM 16GB以上が必要"],"ko":["Python 3.8+와 PyTorch 1.10+를 사용","CUDA 11.0+와 GPU VRAM 8GB 이상이 필요","단백질 언어 모델의 예측과 설계를 지원","Modal과 biomodals를 사용하여 설정과 실행","RAM 16GB 이상이 필요"],"es":["Requiere Python 3.8+ para funcionar","Utiliza PyTorch 1.10+ para el procesamiento","Necesita CUDA 11.0+ para la aceleración","Requiere un mínimo de 8GB de VRAM en la GPU","Soporta la ejecución de ESM2 con Modal"],"fr":["Nécessite Python 3.8+ pour fonctionner","Utilise PyTorch 1.10+ pour le traitement","Nécessite CUDA 11.0+ pour l''accélération","Requiert un minimum de 8GB de VRAM sur la GPU","Prend en charge l''exécution de ESM2 avec Modal"],"de":["Benötigt Python 3.8+, um zu funktionieren","Verwendet PyTorch 1.10+ für die Verarbeitung","Benötigt CUDA 11.0+ für die Beschleunigung","Benötigt mindestens 8GB VRAM auf der GPU","Unterstützt die Ausführung von ESM2 mit Modal"],"pt":["Requer Python 3.8+","Compatível com PyTorch 1.10+","Suporta CUDA 11.0+","Requer pelo menos 8GB de VRAM","Recomenda 24GB de VRAM (A10G)","Requer pelo menos 16GB de RAM"],"ru":["Требует Python 3.8+","Совместим с PyTorch 1.10+","Поддерживает CUDA 11.0+","Требует как минимум 8GB видеопамяти","Рекомендуется 24GB видеопамяти (A10G)","Требует как минимум 16GB оперативной памяти"],"ar":["يتطلب بايثون 3.8+","متوافق مع بايرتوش 1.10+","يدعم كودا 11.0+","يتطلب على الأقل 8GB من ذاكرة الفيديو","ينصح ب 24GB من ذاكرة الفيديو (A10G)","يتطلب على الأقل 16GB من ذاكرة الوصول العشوائي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use esm for protein design","esm vs other protein design tools","esm installation guide","what is esm protein design","esm alternative protein design tools","esm setup guide for Modal","esm protein design tutorial","esm prerequisites and requirements","esm protein language model"],"zh":["ESM蛋白质设计工具","Python蛋白质语言模型","PyTorch蛋白质设计","CUDA蛋白质计算","GPU蛋白质设计","蛋白质语言模型设置","biomodals设置","Modal设置"],"ja":["ESMタンパク質設計ツール","Pythonタンパク質言語モデル","PyTorchタンパク質設計","CUDAタンパク質計算","GPUタンパク質設計","タンパク質言語モデルの設定","biomodalsの設定","Modalの設定","AIエージェント"],"ko":["ESM 단백질 설계 도구","Python 단백질 언어 모델","PyTorch 단백질 설계","CUDA 단백질 계산","GPU 단백질 설계","단백질 언어 모델 설정","biomodals 설정","Modal 설정","AI 에이전트"],"es":["ESM","diseño de proteínas","Claude Code","Python 3.8+","PyTorch 1.10+","CUDA 11.0+","Modal","proteínas","biomodales"],"fr":["ESM","conception de protéines","Claude Code","Python 3.8+","PyTorch 1.10+","CUDA 11.0+","Modal","protéines","biomodales"],"de":["ESM","Proteindesign","Claude Code","Python 3.8+","PyTorch 1.10+","CUDA 11.0+","Modal","Proteine","Biomodale"],"pt":["ESM2","design de proteínas","Python","PyTorch","CUDA","GPU","VRAM","RAM","configuração do ESM2","instalação do ESM2"],"ru":["ESM2","проектирование белков","Python","PyTorch","CUDA","GPU","VRAM","RAM","настройка ESM2","установка ESM2"],"ar":["إسم2","تصميم البروتينات","بايثون","بايرتوش","كودا","GPU","VRAM","RAM","إعداد إسم2","تثبيت إسم2"]}},"owner":"adaptyvbio","repo":"protein-design-skills","repoPath":"adaptyvbio/protein-design-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.270Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"esm","description":">","tags":["sequence-design","embeddings","scoring"],"bodyPreview":"# ESM2 Protein Language Model\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n| Requirement | Minimum | Recommended |\n|-------------|---------|-------------|\n| Python | 3.8+ | 3.10 |\n| PyTorch | 1.10+ | 2.0+ |\n| CUDA | 11.0+ | 11.7+ |\n| GPU VRAM | 8GB | 24GB (A10G) |\n| RAM | 16GB | 32GB |\n\n## How to run\n\n> **First time?** See [Installation Guide](../../docs/installation.md) to set up Modal and biomodals.\n\n### Option 1: Modal\n```bash\ncd biomodals\nmodal run modal_esm2_predict_masked.py \\\n  --input-faa sequences.fasta \\\n  --ou","body":"# ESM2 Protein Language Model\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n| Requirement | Minimum | Recommended |\n|-------------|---------|-------------|\n| Python | 3.8+ | 3.10 |\n| PyTorch | 1.10+ | 2.0+ |\n| CUDA | 11.0+ | 11.7+ |\n| GPU VRAM | 8GB | 24GB (A10G) |\n| RAM | 16GB | 32GB |\n\n## How to run\n\n> **First time?** See [Installation Guide](../../docs/installation.md) to set up Modal and biomodals.\n\n### Option 1: Modal\n```bash\ncd biomodals\nmodal run modal_esm2_predict_masked.py \\\n  --input-faa sequences.fasta \\\n  --out-dir embeddings/\n```\n\n**GPU**: A10G (24GB) | **Timeout**: 300s default\n\n### Option 2: Python API (recommended)\n```python\nimport torch\nimport esm\n\n# Load model\nmodel, alphabet = esm.pretrained.esm2_t33_650M_UR50D()\nbatch_converter = alphabet.get_batch_converter()\nmodel = model.eval().cuda()\n\n# Process sequences\ndata = [(\"seq1\", \"MKTAYIAKQRQISFVK...\")]\nbatch_labels, batch_strs, batch_tokens = batch_converter(data)\n\nwith torch.no_grad():\n    results = model(batch_tokens.cuda(), repr_layers=[33])\n\n# Get embeddings\nembeddings = results[\"representations\"][33]\n```\n\n## Key parameters\n\n### ESM2 Models\n\n| Model | Parameters | Speed | Quality |\n|-------|------------|-------|---------|\n| esm2_t6_8M | 8M | Fastest | Fast screening |\n| esm2_t12_35M | 35M | Fast | Good |\n| esm2_t33_650M | 650M | Medium | Better |\n| esm2_t36_3B | 3B | Slow | Best |\n\n## Output format\n\n```\nembeddings/\n├── embeddings.npy       # (N, 1280) array\n├── pll_scores.csv       # PLL for each sequence\n└── metadata.json        # Sequence info\n```\n\n## Sample output\n\n### Successful run\n```\n$ modal run modal_esm2_predict_masked.py --input-faa designs.fasta\n[INFO] Loading ESM2-650M model...\n[INFO] Processing 100 sequences...\n[INFO] Computing pseudo-log-likelihood...\n\nembeddings/pll_scores.csv:\nsequence_id,pll,pll_normalized,length\ndesign_0,-0.82,0.15,78\ndesign_1,-0.95,0.08,85\ndesign_2,-1.23,-0.12,72\n...\n\nSummary:\n  Mean PLL: -0.91\n  Sequences with PLL > 0: 42/100 (42%)\n```\n\n**What good output looks like:**\n- PLL_normalized: > 0.0 (more natural-like)\n- Embeddings shape: (N, 1280) for 650M model\n- Higher PLL = more natural sequence\n\n## Decision tree\n\n```\nShould I use ESM2?\n│\n├─ What do you need?\n│  ├─ Sequence plausibility score → ESM2 PLL ✓\n│  ├─ Embeddings for clustering → ESM2 ✓\n│  ├─ Variant effect prediction → ESM2 ✓\n│  └─ Structure prediction → Use ESMFold\n│\n├─ What model size?\n│  ├─ Fast screening → esm2_t12_35M\n│  ├─ Standard use → esm2_t33_650M ✓\n│  └─ Best quality → esm2_t36_3B\n│\n└─ Use case?\n   ├─ QC filtering → PLL > 0.0 threshold\n   ├─ Diversity analysis → Mean-pooled embeddings\n   └─ Mutation scanning → Per-position log-odds\n```\n\n## PLL interpretation\n\n| Normalized PLL | Interpretation |\n|----------------|----------------|\n| > 0.2 | Very natural sequence |\n| 0.0 - 0.2 | Good, natural-like |\n| -0.5 - 0.0 | Acceptable |\n| < -0.5 | May be unnatural |\n\n## Typical performance\n\n| Campaign Size | Time (A10G) | Cost (Modal) | Notes |\n|---------------|-------------|--------------|-------|\n| 100 sequences | 5-10 min | ~$1 | Quick screen |\n| 1000 sequences | 30-60 min | ~$5 | Standard |\n| 5000 sequences | 2-3h | ~$20 | Large batch |\n\n**Throughput**: ~100-200 sequences/minute with 650M model.\n\n---\n\n## Verify\n\n```bash\nwc -l embeddings/pll_scores.csv  # Should match input + 1 (header)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**OOM errors**: Use smaller model or batch sequences\n**Slow processing**: Use esm2_t12_35M for speed\n**Low PLL scores**: May indicate unusual/designed sequences\n\n### Error interpretation\n\n| Error | Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| `RuntimeError: CUDA out of memory` | Sequence too long or large batch | Reduce batch size |\n| `KeyError: representation` | Wrong layer requested | Use layer 33 for 650M model |\n| `ValueError: sequence` | Invalid amino acid | Check for non-standard AAs |\n\n---\n\n**Next**: Structure prediction with `chai` or `boltz` → `protein-qc` for filtering.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:09.815Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents focused on Bioinformatics and Protein Design, such as Claude Code, requiring advanced PyTorch and CUDA capabilities.","zh":"适用于专注于生物信息学和蛋白质设计的AI代理，例如Claude Code，需要高级PyTorch和CUDA能力。","ja":"Bioinformaticsとタンパク質設計に特化したAIエージェント、たとえばClaude Codeに適しています。これらは高度なPyTorchとCUDAの機能を必要とします。","ko":"생물 정보학 및 단백질 설계에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트(Claude Code 등)에 적합하며 고급 PyTorch 및 CUDA 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA centrados en bioinformática y diseño de proteínas, como Claude Code, que requieren capacidades avanzadas de PyTorch y CUDA.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA axés sur la bioinformatique et la conception de protéines, tels que Claude Code, nécessitant des capacités avancées de PyTorch et CUDA.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die auf Bioinformatik und Proteindesign spezialisiert sind, wie Claude Code, und die erweiterte PyTorch- und CUDA-Funktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados em Bioinformática e Projeto de Proteínas, como Claude Code, que exigem capacidades avançadas de PyTorch e CUDA.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на биоинформатику и проектирование белков, таких как Claude Code, требующих расширенных возможностей PyTorch и CUDA.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكية الذين يركزون على المعلومات الحيوية وتصميم البروتين، مثل Claude Code، والذي يتطلب قدرات متقدمة من PyTorch و CUDA."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design proteins using the ESM2 protein language model, leveraging Python, PyTorch, and CUDA for comprehensive content analysis and generation, with support for GPU acceleration and large VRAM for efficient processing.","zh":"赋予代理使用ESM2蛋白质语言模型设计蛋白质的能力，利用Python、PyTorch和CUDA进行全面内容分析和生成，并支持GPU加速和大容量VRAM以实现高效处理。","ja":"ESM2タンパク質言語モデルを使用してタンパク質を設計するエージェントの能力を付与します。Python、PyTorch、CUDAを利用して包括的なコンテンツ分析および生成を行い、GPUアクセラレーションおよび大容量VRAMをサポートして効率的な処理を実現します。","ko":"ESM2 단백질 언어 모델을 사용하여 단백질을 설계하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다. Python, PyTorch, CUDA를 활용하여 포괄적인 내용 분석 및 생성을 수행하며, GPU 가속 및 대용량 VRAM을 지원하여 효율적인 처리를 실현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar proteínas utilizando el modelo de lenguaje de proteínas ESM2, aprovechando Python, PyTorch y CUDA para un análisis y generación de contenido integral, con soporte para aceleración de GPU y gran VRAM para un procesamiento eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des protéines en utilisant le modèle de langage de protéines ESM2, en exploitant Python, PyTorch et CUDA pour une analyse et une génération de contenu complètes, avec une prise en charge de l''accélération GPU et d''une grande VRAM pour un traitement efficace.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Proteine mit dem ESM2-Protein-Sprachmodell zu entwerfen, indem es Python, PyTorch und CUDA für eine umfassende Inhaltsanalyse und -generierung nutzt, mit Unterstützung für GPU-Beschleunigung und großem VRAM für effizientes Verarbeiten.","pt":"Habilita agentes a projetar proteínas usando o modelo de linguagem de proteínas ESM2, aproveitando Python, PyTorch e CUDA para análise e geração de conteúdo abrangentes, com suporte à aceleração de GPU e grande VRAM para processamento eficiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать белки с помощью модели языка белков ESM2, используя Python, PyTorch и CUDA для всестороннего анализа и генерации контента, с поддержкой ускорения GPU и большой VRAM для эффективной обработки.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تصميم البروتينات باستخدام نموذج لغة البروتين ESM2، وتحقيق ذلك من خلال استخدام Python و PyTorch و CUDA لتحليل المحتوى الشامل وتوليد المحتوى، مع دعم تسريع GPU و VRAM كبير لعمليات المعالجة الفعالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing novel proteins with specific functions","Predicting protein structures from sequences","Analyzing protein-ligand interactions with PyTorch"],"zh":["设计具有特定功能的新型蛋白质","从序列预测蛋白质结构","使用PyTorch分析蛋白质-配体相互作用"],"ja":["特定の機能を持つ新規タンパク質の設計","シーケンスからのタンパク質構造の予測","PyTorchを使用したタンパク質-リガンド相互作用の分析"],"ko":["특정 기능을 가진 신규 단백질 설계","서열로부터 단백질 구조 예측","PyTorch를 사용한 단백질-리간드 상호작용 분석"],"es":["Diseñar proteínas novelas con funciones específicas","Predecir estructuras de proteínas a partir de secuencias","Analizar interacciones proteína-ligando con PyTorch"],"fr":["Concevoir des protéines nouvelles avec des fonctions spécifiques","Prévoir les structures de protéines à partir de séquences","Analyser les interactions protéine-ligand avec PyTorch"],"de":["Neue Proteine mit spezifischen Funktionen entwerfen","Proteinstrukturen aus Sequenzen vorhersagen","Protein-Ligand-Wechselwirkungen mit PyTorch analysieren"],"pt":["Projetar novas proteínas com funções específicas","Prever estruturas de proteínas a partir de sequências","Analisar interações proteína-ligante com PyTorch"],"ru":["Проектировать новые белки с конкретными функциями","Предсказывать структуры белков из последовательностей","Анализировать взаимодействия белок-лиганд с помощью PyTorch"],"ar":["تصميم بروتينات جديدة مع وظائف محددة","التنبؤ بتركيب البروتينات من التسلسلات","تحليل التفاعلات البروتين-الليган्ड باستخدام PyTorch"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.8+","Needs PyTorch 1.10+ and CUDA 11.0+","Demands significant GPU VRAM (minimum 8GB) and RAM (minimum 16GB)"],"zh":["需要Python 3.8+","需要PyTorch 1.10+和CUDA 11.0+","需要大量GPU VRAM（最低8GB）和RAM（最低16GB）"],"ja":["Python 3.8+が必要","PyTorch 1.10+とCUDA 11.0+が必要","大量のGPU VRAM（最低8GB）とRAM（最低16GB）が必要"],"ko":["Python 3.8+ 필요","PyTorch 1.10+ 및 CUDA 11.0+ 필요","大量의 GPU VRAM(최소 8GB) 및 RAM(최소 16GB) 필요"],"es":["Requiere Python 3.8+","Necesita PyTorch 1.10+ y CUDA 11.0+","Exige una cantidad significativa de VRAM de GPU (mínimo 8GB) y RAM (mínimo 16GB)"],"fr":["Nécessite Python 3.8+","A besoin de PyTorch 1.10+ et CUDA 11.0+","Exige une quantité significative de VRAM de GPU (minimum 8GB) et de RAM (minimum 16GB)"],"de":["Benötigt Python 3.8+","Benötigt PyTorch 1.10+ und CUDA 11.0+","Erfordert eine erhebliche Menge an GPU-VRAM (mindestens 8GB) und RAM (mindestens 16GB)"],"pt":["Exige Python 3.8+","Necessita PyTorch 1.10+ e CUDA 11.0+","Exige VRAM de GPU significativa (mínimo 8GB) e RAM (mínimo 16GB)"],"ru":["Требует Python 3.8+","Требует PyTorch 1.10+ и CUDA 11.0+","Требует значительной VRAM GPU (минимум 8GB) и RAM (минимум 16GB)"],"ar":["يتطلب Python 3.8+","يتطلب PyTorch 1.10+ و CUDA 11.0+","يتطلب VRAM كبير لجهاز GPU (أدنى حد 8GB) و RAM (أدنى حد 16GB)"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"2d7e73ce818b008508ddab26273fd2e89607ca6e723a7033cf947f1e22903217","qualityScore":59}');
