"Verwendung der Registrierungs-API, um Fähigkeiten zu entdecken"],"pt":["Instalação de novas capacidades para agentes de IA","Gerenciamento de habilidades instaladas (listar, atualizar, desinstalar)","Publicação de habilidades para compartilhar com a comunidade","Pesquisa e descoberta de novas habilidades com o Skild Index","Uso da Registry API para descoberta unificada"],"ru":["Установка новых возможностей для ИИ агентов","Управление установленными навыками (список, обновление, удаление)","Публикация навыков для обмена с сообществом","Поиск и открытие новых навыков с помощью Skild Index","Использование Registry API для унифицированного поиска"],"ar":["تثبيت قدرات جديدة lwkala'' الذكاء الاصطناعي","إدارة المهارات المثبتة (قائمة، تحديث، إزالة)","نشر المهارات لمشاركتها مع المجتمع","البحث عن اكتشاف مهارات جديدة مع Skild Index","استخدام Registry API للبحث الموحد"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use skild","skild install","skild alternative","what is skild","skild setup guide","skild vs npm","ai agent skills management","skild registry api"],"zh":["AI智能工具包","skild","包管理器","AI工具包安装","AI工具包管理","AI工具包发布","Registry API","AI智能工具包搜索"],"ja":["AIエージェント","skild","パッケージマネージャー","AIエージェントの能力","AIエージェントの能力のインストール","AIエージェントの能力の管理","Registry API","AIエージェントの能力の検索"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","skild","패키지 관리자","AI 에이전트 능력","AI 에이전트 능력 설치","AI 에이전트 능력 관리","Registry API","AI 에이전트 능력 검색"],"es":["skild","Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial","habilidades de agentes","administrador de paquetes","instalación de habilidades","gestión de habilidades","publicación de habilidades","búsqueda de habilidades","índice de skild"],"fr":["skild","Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle","compétences des agents","gestionnaire de paquets","installation de compétences","gestion de compétences","publication de compétences","recherche de compétences","index de skild"],"de":["skild","künstliche Intelligenzagenten","Fähigkeiten von Agenten","Paketmanager","Installation von Fähigkeiten","Verwaltung von Fähigkeiten","Veröffentlichung von Fähigkeiten","Suche nach Fähigkeiten","skild-Index"],"pt":["skild","gerenciador de pacotes para habilidades de agente de IA","instalação de habilidades de agente","gerenciamento de habilidades de agente","publicação de habilidades de agente","Skild Index","Registry API","agentes de IA","habilidades de agente de IA"],"ru":["skild","менеджер пакетов для навыков ИИ агентов","установка навыков агента","управление навыками агента","публикация навыков агента","Skild Index","Registry API","ИИ агенты","навыки ИИ агентов"],"ar":["skild","مدير حزم لمهارات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تثبيت مهارات وكلاء","إدارة مهارات وكلاء","نشر مهارات وكلاء","Skild Index","Registry API","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","مهارات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Peiiii","repo":"skild","repoPath":"Peiiii/skild","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.276Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skild","description":"Skill package manager for AI Agents — install, manage, and publish Agent Skills.","version":"0.2.10","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# skild\n\n**skild** is the package manager for Agent Skills — like npm, but for AI agents.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Installing new capabilities for AI agents\n- Managing installed Skills (list, update, uninstall)\n- Publishing Skills to share with the community\n- Searching or discovering new Skills\n\n## Agent Search & Discovery (Skild Index)\n\nWhen an agent needs to find Skills from the Skild index (registry + linked + auto catalog), use the Registry API:\n\n```bash\n# Unified discovery (","body":"# skild\n\n**skild** is the package manager for Agent Skills — like npm, but for AI agents.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Installing new capabilities for AI agents\n- Managing installed Skills (list, update, uninstall)\n- Publishing Skills to share with the community\n- Searching or discovering new Skills\n\n## Agent Search & Discovery (Skild Index)\n\nWhen an agent needs to find Skills from the Skild index (registry + linked + auto catalog), use the Registry API:\n\n```bash\n# Unified discovery (registry + linked skills)\ncurl \"https://registry.skild.sh/discover?q=<query>&limit=20\"\n\n# Resolve a short alias (optional)\ncurl \"https://registry.skild.sh/resolve?alias=<alias>\"\n```\n\n**Notes:**\n- Prefer `alias` if present; it provides the shortest install command.\n- Use the returned `install` string directly (quotes may appear when a `#ref` is required).\n- `/discover` supports pagination and filtering:\n  - `cursor=<nextCursor>` for pagination\n  - `sort=updated|new|downloads_7d|downloads_30d|stars|stars_30d`\n  - `skillset=true|false` and `category=<id>` to narrow results\n- If you need to browse linked items only:\n  - `https://registry.skild.sh/linked-items?limit=20`\n- CLI `skild search` uses the same unified index.\n\n## Agent Workflow (Recommended)\n\n1) Search via `/discover` and shortlist results by description/tags.  \n2) Confirm with the user and pick the best match.  \n3) Install using the provided `install` command (or alias).  \n4) Manage using `skild list / info / update / uninstall / sync`.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nNode.js ≥18 is required.\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g skild\n```\n\n## Core Commands\n\n### Install a Skill\n\n```bash\n# From GitHub (shorthand)\nskild install owner/repo/path/to/skill\n\n# From registry\nskild install @publisher/skill-name\n\n# From local directory\nskild install ./my-skill\n\n# Aliases (npm-style)\nskild add @publisher/skill-name\nskild i @publisher/skill-name\n\n# Pick one Skill when source has multiple SKILL.md\nskild install owner/repo --skill skills/pdf\n```\n\n### List Installed Skills\n\n```bash\nskild list\n```\n\nOutput groups Skills by type: Skillsets, Skills, Dependencies.\n\n### Manage Skills\n\n```bash\nskild info <skill>       # Show details\nskild update <skill>     # Update to latest\nskild uninstall <skill>  # Remove\nskild validate <path>    # Validate structure\nskild sync [skills...]   # Sync across platforms\n```\n\n### Search Registry\n\n```bash\nskild search <query>\n```\n\nBrowse online: [hub.skild.sh](https://hub.skild.sh)\n\n## Target Platforms\n\n| Platform | Option | Global Path | Project Path |\n|----------|--------|-------------|--------------|\n| Claude | `-t claude` (default) | `~/.claude/skills` | `./.claude/skills` |\n| Codex | `-t codex` | `~/.codex/skills` | `./.codex/skills` |\n| Copilot | `-t copilot` | `~/.github/skills` | `./.github/skills` |\n| Antigravity | `-t antigravity` | `~/.gemini/antigravity/skills` | `./.agent/skills` |\n| OpenCode | `-t opencode` | `~/.config/opencode/skill` | `./.opencode/skill` |\n| Cursor | `-t cursor` | `~/.cursor/skills` | `./.cursor/skills` |\n| Windsurf | `-t windsurf` | `~/.windsurf/skills` | `./.windsurf/skills` |\n| Agents | `-t agents` | `~/.agents/skills` | `./.agents/skills` |\n\n```bash\n# Example: Install to Antigravity\nskild install @publisher/skill -t antigravity\n\n# Project-level installation\nskild install @publisher/skill --local\n```\n\n## Defaults & Scope\n\n```bash\n# Default platform & scope\nskild config set defaultPlatform codex\nskild config set defaultScope project\n\n# Default repo for push\nskild config set push.defaultRepo owner/repo\n```\n\n## Skillsets\n\nSkillsets bundle multiple Skills for one-command installation:\n\n```bash\nskild install @skild/data-analyst-pack\n# Installs: csv, pandas, sql-helper...\n```\n\n## Publishing Skills\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create account\nskild signup\n\n# 2. Login\nskild login\n\n# 3. Publish\nskild publish --dir ./my-skill\n```\n\n## Push to Git Repos (Registry-free)\n\nUse `skild push` to sync a Skill into a Git repository and push changes.\n\n```bash\n# Push to GitHub by owner/repo\nskild push owner/repo --dir ./my-skill\n\n# Set a default repo (omit <repo> afterwards)\nskild config set push.defaultRepo owner/repo\nskild push --dir ./my-skill\n\n# Push to a local repo path\nskild push ~/work/skills-repo --local --dir ./my-skill\n\n# Push to a specific subdirectory\nskild push owner/repo --dir ./my-skill --path skills/my-skill\n\n# Push to a branch (or append #branch to the repo)\nskild push owner/repo#dev --dir ./my-skill\n```\n\n**Notes:**\n- The target path defaults to `skills/<skill-name>` derived from `SKILL.md`.\n- Target path cannot be the repo root.\n- The command clones, commits, and pushes to the remote branch.\n- For `owner/repo`, skild tries SSH first and falls back to HTTPS if SSH auth fails.\n- `skild push <repo>` always overrides the default repo.\n- You can also set `SKILD_DEFAULT_PUSH_REPO` to override the default repo per shell.\n\n## Command Reference\n\nFor the complete command reference with all options, see [commands.md](./commands.md).\n\n## Skillsets\n\nFor detailed Skillsets guide (bundles of Skills), see [skillsets.md](./skillsets.md).\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\nFor common issues and solutions, see [troubleshooting.md](./troubleshooting.md).\n\n## More Info\n\n- Website: [skild.sh](https://skild.sh)\n- Hub: [hub.skild.sh](https://hub.skild.sh)\n- Documentation: [GitHub](https://github.com/Peiiii/skild/tree/main/docs)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:41.570Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agent Developers needing streamlined skill management and discovery capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要简化技能管理和发现能力的AI代理开发人员。","ja":"AIエージェント開発者がストリームライン化されたスキル管理と発見機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"스트림라인화 된 스킬 관리 및 발견 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트 개발자에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para desarrolladores de Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial que necesitan capacidades de gestión y descubrimiento de habilidades optimizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les développeurs d''agents d''intelligence artificielle ayant besoin d''une gestion et d''une découverte de compétences rationalisées.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Agent-Entwickler, die eine optimierte Fähigkeitsverwaltung und -entdeckung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para desenvolvedores de Agentes de IA que precisam de gerenciamento e capacidades de descoberta de habilidades otimizados.","ru":"Идеально для разработчиков агентов ИИ, которым необходимы оптимизированные возможности управления и обнаружения навыков.","ar":"مثالي لمطوري وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة مهارات وتوفر القدرات بسهولة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to easily install, manage, and publish skills using the Skild package manager, leveraging the Registry API for unified discovery and supporting protocols like npm.","zh":"赋予代理轻松安装、管理和发布技能的能力，使用Skild包管理器，利用Registry API进行统一发现，并支持类似npm的协议。","ja":"エージェントがSkildパッケージマネージャーを使用してスキルを簡単にインストール、管理、公開できるようにし、Registry APIを使用して統一された発見を実現し、npmのようなプロトコルをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 Skild 패키지 관리자를 사용하여 스킬을 쉽게 설치, 관리 및 게시 할 수 있으며, Registry API를 사용하여 통합 검색을 실현하며 npm 같은 프로토콜을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a instalar, gestionar y publicar habilidades fácilmente mediante el administrador de paquetes Skild, aprovechando la Registry API para la descubierta unificada y admitiendo protocolos como npm.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''installer, de gérer et de publier des compétences facilement à l''aide du gestionnaire de paquets Skild, en exploitant la Registry API pour une découverte unifiée et en prenant en charge des protocoles tels que npm.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Fähigkeiten mithilfe des Skild-Paketmanagers einfach zu installieren, zu verwalten und zu veröffentlichen, indem die Registry API für die einheitliche Entdeckung genutzt und Protokolle wie npm unterstützt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a instalar, gerenciar e publicar habilidades facilmente usando o gerenciador de pacotes Skild, aproveitando a API do Registro para descoberta unificada e suportando protocolos como o npm.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью легко устанавливать, управлять и публиковать навыки с помощью менеджера пакетов Skild, используя API реестра для унифицированного обнаружения и поддержки протоколов như npm.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تثبيت إدارة والنشر بسهولة من خلال مدير الحزم Skild، واستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات السجل للكشف الموحد ودعم بروتوكولات مثل npm"},"useCases":{"en":["Installing new agent capabilities","Managing and updating existing skills","Publishing skills to the Skild index for community sharing","Discovering new skills through the Skild registry and catalog"],"zh":["安装新的代理功能","管理和更新现有的技能","发布技能到Skild索引以便社区共享","通过Skild注册表和目录发现新的技能"],"ja":["新しいエージェント機能のインストール","既存のスキルの管理と更新","Skildインデックスへのスキル公開によるコミュニティシェア","Skildレジストリとカタログを介した新しいスキルの発見"],"ko":["新的 에이전트 기능을 설치","기존의 스킬을 관리 및 업데이트","Skild 색인에 스킬을 게시하여 커뮤니티 공유","Skild 등록 및 카탈로그를 통한 새로운 스킬 발견"],"es":["Instalar nuevas capacidades de agente","Gestionar y actualizar habilidades existentes","Publicar habilidades en el índice Skild para el intercambio comunitario","Descubrir nuevas habilidades a través del registro y catálogo Skild"],"fr":["Installer de nouvelles capacités d''agent","Gérer et mettre à jour des compétences existantes","Publier des compétences dans l''index Skild pour un partage communautaire","Découvrir de nouvelles compétences via le registre et le catalogue Skild"],"de":["Installation neuer Agentenfähigkeiten","Verwalten und Aktualisieren bestehender Fähigkeiten","Veröffentlichen von Fähigkeiten im Skild-Index für Gemeinschaftsteilung","Entdecken neuer Fähigkeiten über das Skild-Register und -Katalog"],"pt":["Instalar novas capacidades de agente","Gerenciar e atualizar habilidades existentes","Publicar habilidades no índice Skild para compartilhamento da comunidade","Descobrir novas habilidades por meio do registro e catálogo Skild"],"ru":["Установка новых возможностей агента","Управление и обновление существующих навыков","Публикация навыков в индексе Skild для обмена сообществом","Обнаружение новых навыков через реестр и каталог Skild"],"ar":["تثبيت قدرات جديدة للوكيل","إدارة وتحديث المهارات الحالية","نشر المهارات في فهرس Skild لمشاركة المجتمع","اكتشاف مهارات جديدة من خلال السجل وفهرس Skild"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the Skild index and registry","Limited to AI agent skills management"],"zh":["需要访问Skild索引和注册表","仅限AI代理技能管理"],"ja":["Skildインデックスとレジストリへのアクセスが必要","AIエージェントスキル管理のみに限定"],"ko":["Skild 색인 및 등록의 액세스가 필요","AI 에이전트 스킬 관리에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al índice y registro Skild","Limitado a la gestión de habilidades de agentes de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''index et au registre Skild","Limité à la gestion des compétences des agents d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Skild-Index und das Register","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung von Fähigkeiten von künstlichen Intelligenz-Agenten"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao índice e registro Skild","Limitado ao gerenciamento de habilidades de agente de IA"],"ru":["Требует доступа к индексу и реестру Skild","Ограничен управлением навыками агента ИИ"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى فهرس Skild والسجل","محدود بإدارة مهارات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"1a646f1a3ea62ad7724b4cf478e9ceb91c10bb91973002c887f43ab4c7111e3f","qualityScore":59}');
